<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Makua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Nayohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Malhove Orera a Yesu Kuristo thoko chilhepiye aya ni Nayohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nayohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoha</para>
  <para style="mt2">Malhove Orera a Yesu Kuristo thoko chilhepiye aya ni</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nayohana</para>
  <para style="imt">Malhove o uholhelha</para>
  <para style="ip">Ikitabu yo injili ilhepieye ni Nayohana phi imoka yo ichitabu ncheshe nhina Malhehano o Naanano anohimiacha ukumi ni makhalhelho a Yesu Kuristo. Kila imoka yo chechiyo ncheshe chiyo ineehaniya “injili,” maana aya akhalhaka “malhove orera.” Chaalhepiye ni Namatayo, Namako, ashinna Luka ni Nayohana baada yo ukhwa wa Yesu. Ikitabu yo injili i Nayohana yaalhepiye veekinaka ni owiittucha Nayohana vaatameria iyaakha yo 90 baada yo uyaria wa Kuristo. Inakhalhaka chiicho etu, ikitabu iyo khinaahimiacha Nayohana wiira phi lhepilhe, uno iphiro ilhepiye aya ilhikaanaka chinene ni iwarakha yo upacha i Nayohana, iwarakha yo nayelhi i Nayohana ni iwarakha yo neraru i Nayohana. Attu o ulhepa akina o khalhayi anaahimiacha Nayohana wiira aakhalha iwani yo Uefeso yeyo ikatema iyo. Paahi etu ilhikaanaka wiira ilha ikitabu ilha yaalhepiye Uefeso. Nayohana anoohimiacha mwaari nlhatu uri nkitabuni wiira yaakavihe attu arumelhelhe wiira Yesu phi Kuristo, Mwaana a Nlhuku nkumi (nlhako wo 20:31). Wo urumelhelha nenno nlhove nno nipatte ukumi wo nchina nawe. Ikitabu ilha yaalhepiye irwee yashomiye ni onkhaye Ayahudi ni ahiri Ayahudi. Injili i Nayohana wo iphiro chikina khinolhikaana ni injili chikina tttaaru chiyo. Nayohana anoweha chinene mwaha wo cho ushangiha chaapannge awe Yesu, ahihimiachaka chinene mwaha wo malhikaaniho eettuchiha awe Yesu. Chittu chikina chulhupalhe thoko ubatiiziya wa Yesu ni ulhikachiya uthakoni khachinohimiachiya nhina injili ilha.</para>
  <para style="iot">Chiri nhina</para>
  <para style="io">Nayohana anoochokholha injili (nlhako wo 1:1-18:2).</para>
  <para style="io">Tho anoolhepa mwaha unaacha cho ushangiha chaapangilhe awe Yesu (nlhako wo 1:19-12:50).</para>
  <para style="io">Tho, anoohiamcha miaha chinchi chinoholhelha nookhwa ni uhihimmwa wawe (nlhako wo 13:1-20:31).</para>
  <para style="io">Nayohana anomalhiha injili aya wo uhimiacha ikatema imoka Yesu vaakhumelhenlhe awe attu baada yo uhihimmwa wawe ni uhimiacha nnikwa aya wo uchokholha ulhepa injili ilha (nlhako wo 21).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Nlhove ninowiiha ukumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Vaachokhonlhe aya chittu chonkhaye chihinoopiya, Nlhove ahaawo, ni uyo aari ni Nlhuku, ni uyo aari Nlhuku. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Toka vaachokhonlhe aya Nlhove aari vamoka ni Nlhuku. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Nlhuku voopilhe awe chittu chonkhaye ahaawo, khiiwo iriyoothe yoopiye wo uhikhalha yoyo. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Nlhove phi aari machokholhelho o ukumi ni uyo ukumi uyo nkawaawiha nthuko wa attu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Nthuko waamwalhelha mwiipiphini, ni ipiphi khayoonrie utipiha yoyo nthuko uyo.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Nlhuku ahonruma karumiya awe, eehaniya Yohana, <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />aawilhe uhimiechesha wa attu mwaha wo yoyo nthuko uyo, attu eewe ni urumelhelha. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Nayohana khayaari yoyo nthuko uyo, nansho aawilhe uhimiechesha wa attu mwaha wo yoyo nthuko uyo. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Yolha phi nthuko we ikekhiaye, nthuko unowa velhaponi ni wamwalhelha attu onkhaye.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Paahi Nlhove ahaawo velhaponi, ni wo iphiro awe ilhapo yahoopiya, nansho inakhalhaka chiicho, attu o velhaponi khanchuwenlhe. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Aawilhe velhaponi vawe mwanene, nansho attu awawe khayampochenre. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Akina, nansho, ampochenre ni unrumelhelha, yayo ahaavaha ikuru yo ukhalha ashaana a Nlhuku phi alhe arumelhenlhe nchina nawe. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Ahikhalhaka ashaana a Nlhuku wo iphiro thoko cho uyariya ni ntu, mena mattunelho a ntu, Nlhuku mwanene phi ari athumwanaya.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Yoyo Nlhove uyo nkaakhalha ntu, nkaakhalha uwanihu. Ni hii nahoona nthimicho wawe, nthimicho wawe yoyo ri Mwaana o vekhawe a Nlhuku chanre nnema ni ikeekhene.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Nayohana nkayaahimiechesha wa attu mwaha wawe. Nkayaakhuwelha eeraka, “Yolha phi ulhe kanhimianche aka venre aka wiira, ‘Noowa ntu mmoka vatulhi waka, ri mulhupalhe ukipwaha mii, ukhalhawaya ahaawo kihinayariaa.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Wo nnema wawe mwinchi, hiyaano onkhaye nihopochera mpuha umpwaha mpuha uvinre. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Nlhuku ahonivaha Malhehero wo iphiro ya ashinna Musa, nansho nnema ni ikeekhene chihoniweelha wo iphiro ya Yesu Kuristo. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Khaawo ntu mwonne Nlhuku ikatema iriyoothe. Mwaana vekha awe, aakhalha vamoka ni Nlhuku, phi nichuwelhinhe Athithi.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nttenga u Nayohana Obatiiza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mak 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Wu phi uhimiechesha u Nayohana, ikatema ahoolhelhi a Ayahudi o Yerusalemu vaarumme aya opochera ishaani ni Alawi u Nayohana yaakohe wiira, “Inyuva phi apani?”<verse eid="JHN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Nayohana khakhonte waakhulha, nkayeera wo uhivitha wiira, “Miyaano kakihena Kuristo Moopolhi a attu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Vavawo nkayaakohiya tho, “Inyuva phi apani etu? Chani inyuva phi Naeliya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Nayohana nkaakhulha, “Akihena mii.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Nkayaakohiya tho, “Chani inyuva phi anamilhohi alhe anowehereriya uwa uuromolhani nihuku no uwa Masiya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Nkaakhulha “Akihena mii.”<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Nkayaakohiya tho, “Paahi etu inyuva phi apani? Nnihimerieke mwaanene nlhove nowahimeria anirumme.”<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Nayohana nkaakhulha, “Miyaano phi yolhe anamilhohi ashinna Isaya aahimmie aya yeeraka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">‘Nlhove na ntu niheewaniya muuthakoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">Chookolhiye iphiro cho uvira Athithi!’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Yayo akarumiya yaarumiye ni nlhoko wa Amafarisayo ayo, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />nkayaakoha Nayohana, “Yakhalhaka inyuva kanhena Kuristo, kanhena Naeliya ni vavawo kanhena anamilhohi, woonaka nnowaabatiiza attu?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Nayohana nkayaakhulha, “Miyaano kinaabatiiza attu wo maashi, nansho hawo mmoka eemenlhe munlhokoni mwinyu mwaattiva nhinaaya unchuwelha. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Yoyo nowa utulhi waka, nansho mii kihiphwanelhiyaka inakhalhaka uthaphulha miripwe cho iratu chawe.” <figure style="fig" file="05 Sandals.jpg" size="col" ref="1:27">Ikwakwata nnyaani mwa ntu</figure><verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Yoyo mwaha uyo waakhumelhenlhe Ubethaniya, unosha nchuwa ukhopelhelhe mwolhoko wo Uyorodani, Nayohana vaari aya aabatiizaka attu.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu, Mwaana o Khondoro a Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Waashelhe waya, Nayohana ahomwoona Yesu awaaka, nkayeera, “Ulha phi Mwaana o Khondoro a Nlhuku nothamiha uwonya wa attu. <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Yolha phi ulhe kanhimianche aka wiira, ‘Utulhi waka nowa ntu mmoka ri mulhupalhe ukipwaha mii, ukhalhawaya ahaawo mii kihinayariaa.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Miyaano kimwanene akanchuwenlhe, nansho kiwiilhe uwabatiiza attu wo maashi ikhalhe wiira attu o Uisraeli anchuwelhe.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Nayohana nkayaahimiechesha eeraka, “Kahomwoona Iphumu ya Nlhuku akhuruwaka thoko kaulha ukhuma wiirimu ni ukorelha vanikhathani vawe. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Miyaano akanchuwenlhe, nansho Nlhuku kirumme kaabatiize attu wo maashi ahokihimeria wiira, ‘Ulhe ntu nnohalha inyu umwoona akhuruwelhiyaka ni Iphumu ya Nlhuku ni unkorelha vanikhathani vawe, yoyo phi ntu naabatiiza attu wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Nayohana nkayeera, kihoona, ni mii kihimiecheshe vano wiira yolha phi Mwaana a Nlhuku.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Owiittucha o upacha a Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Waashelhe waya, Nayohana aari vavawo tho vamoka ni owiittucha aya elhi. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Vaamwonne aya Yesu aviraka nkayeera, “Mmwooneke! Ulha phi Mwaana o Khondoro a Nlhuku.”<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Owiittucha aheewa Nayohana voolhumacha aya yayo malhove ayo, nkayanttwaracha Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu nkaarukunuwa, nkoona owiittucha a Nayohana anttwaraka, nkaakoha, “Nnaaviani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Ni ayo nkayaakhulhacha “Rabi, nnokhalha vayi?” Rabi maana aya, “Owiittuchiha.”<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Mmweeke ni inyu nnowoona.” Vavawo waari uchechilho, paahi etu owiittucha ayo nkayaarwaa nkayoona vaakhalha awe, nkayankhalhana uwannyawe nenno nihuku nno.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Naandorea ahima aya Nasimoni Peturo yaari amoka ya attu elhi yeewilhe Nayohana voolhumacha aya, nkayanttwara Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Vahiphincheru Naandorea nkayaakumaana Nasimoni ahima aya, nkayaahimeria wiira, “Nihomwoona Masiya.” Masiya maana aya Kuristo, Moopolhi. <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Nkayaavelhelha Nasimoni wa Yesu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Yesu nkaaweha Nasimoni nkeera, “Inyuva phi Nasimoni mwaana a Nayohana, nansho vano nnohalha wiihaniya Kefa.” Ukhalhawaya we Iyunani nenno nchina nno phi Peturo maana aya mwalha.<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noweehana Nafilipo ni Nanathanieli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Waashelhe waya Yesu nkoona mbaya arwee Ugalilaya. Nkaaphwanya Nafilipo nkeerelha, “Nkittware!” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Nafilipo aari anenchi o Ubethsaida, iwani yaakhalha aya Naandorea ni Napeturo. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Nafilipo ni ayo nkaaphwanya Nanathanieli, nkaahimeria, “Nihomwoona ulhe ashinna Musa anromonlhe aya nhina ikitabu yo Malhehero, ni anamilhohi alhepaka nttenga wawe. Yoyo phi Yesu mwaana a Nayusufu, o Unazareti.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Nanathanieli nkayaakoha Nafilipo, “Ittu yoombone inowooria ukhuma Unazareti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Nafilipo nkayaakhulha, “Mmwe mwoona.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yesu vonne aya Nanathanieli awaaka nkeera, “Mmwooneke! Yolha phi Mwiisraeli mwanenene, khiiwo ittu innananre nhina mwawe!”<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Nanathanieli nkayankoha, “Nkichuwenlhe chani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Yesu nkaakhulha, “Vaari inyu wuthi nkhuyu Nafilipo ahinaya uwihanani kahowoonani.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Vavawo Nanathanieli nkayaamwakhulha Yesu eeraka, “Owiittuchiha, inyuva phi Mwaana a Nlhuku! Inyuva phi Amwene o Uisraeli!”<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu nkeerelha, “Chani nnorumelhelha ukhalhawaya kihouhimeriani wiira kahowoonani vaari inyu wuthi nkhuyu? Nnowa mwoona moolhupalhe upwaha alha!” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Yesu nkaahimeria onkhaye wiira, “Kinouhimeriani ikekhiaye, nnowoona irimu chihulhiaka ni minepa cha Nlhuku chiwelhaka ni ukhuruwa vachulhu vawe Mwaana a Ntu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Arusi Ukaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Nihuku no neraru ahokhalha arusi iwani yo Ukaana, ilhapo yo Ugalilaya, anumwanawe Yesu aari wowo, <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />ni Yesu aholhalheiya vamoka ni owiittucha awe wa arusini uwo. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Idivai yamalheke, anumwanawe nkayaamwiirelha Yesu, “Idivai ihomalha.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Maanyi, nlhatu waani nnokiirelha chiicho. Ikatema aka khinaaya.” <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Anumwane Yesu aheerelha akarumiya, “Ittu iriyoothe inohalha awe uhimeriani mpangeke.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Ayahudi ahanaa malhemalhelho o ukhucha. Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu, chahokhalha vavawo miapu cho malhuku nthanu ni mmoka. Ni kila mwaapu mmoka waahelhiya maashi wo umalhaka madumu makani makhumi melhi ama makhumi mararu. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu nkeerelha akarumiya, “Nchariheke maashi mmiapuni mmo.” Ni ayo nkayaacharihacha maashi mpaka nchulhu tetetete. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Yesu nkeerelhacha akarumiya, “Vano nrikeke ni waarwehelha nankawa.” Nkayaarika ni waarwehelha nankawa, <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />maashi yaathathuwilhe vano ukhalha idivai, ni ayo nkayaalhawiha. Nansho khayaachuwenlhe wiira ikhumme uyi. Nansho akarumiya alhe yaari achuwelhaka ukhumelhenlhe aya. Nankawa nkeehana abwana arusi, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />nkoolhumacha eerelhaka, “Attu onkhaye ampachera thoko ukawa idivai yo uchiva, yamalhaka phi nokawa aya idivai yooririya. Nansho inyuva nhoshunga idivai yo uchiva mpaka nna!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Yesu aapannge yeyo yo ushangiha yo uchokholha iyo Ukaana ilhapo yo Ugalilaya, wowo nkooniha nthimicho wawe, ni owiittucha awe nkayanrumelhelha.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Arusi amalheke, Yesu ni anumwanawe vamoka ni ashihimawe ni owiittucha awe, nkayaarwaa Ukapenaumu ni ukhalha wowo wo mahuku vakani.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noorwaa unupani wa Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mat 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mak 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luk 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Isikuukuu yo Pasaka ya Ayahudi yaari inaatamenrie, paahi etu Yesu nkarwaa Uyerusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Wowo, u Inupa ya Nlhuku nkaaphwanya attu athumihaka ing'ope, ikhondoro, ni ikhunda, ni attu o wakakaniha nchurukhu anari anakhanlhanche mmamezani mwaya aakakhanihaka nchurukhu.<figure style="fig" file="10 Money Changer.jpg" size="col" ref="2:14">Ntu o waakakhaniha nchurukhu</figure> <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Nkaakorosha ikopo yo nttondoro, nkoomolhacha ashinama onkhaye vathe, ikhondoro vamoka ni ing'ope, nkaapitikulhacha imeza chaya, ni umwarushacha nchurukhu u Inupa ya Nlhuku mmo, <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />nkeerelha alhe aathumiha ikhunda alhe wiira, “Nthamihache chilha chittu chilha vaa! Nhipange inupa ya Athumwanaka ukhalha nipuro no upangelha maronda!” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Owiittucha awe nkoopuwelha iholhepiya nhina Malhove Matakatifu wiira, “Uttuna waka inupa inyu Apwiiya Nlhuku unokiiva, ukipahaka thoko mooro.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Aholhelhi a Ayahudi nkayaamwakhulha Yesu wo unkoha, “Nnaapangeke cho ushangiha chaani wooniha wiira nhanaa ikuru yo upangacha yoyo mwaha uyo?” <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Nkaphomolhani ilha inupa ya Nlhuku ilha, ni mii kinotheka tho wo mahuku mararu.”<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Vavawo Ayahudi nkayeera, “Ilha inupa ya Nlhuku ilha, yaathekiye wo umalhaka iyaakha makhumi ncheshe ni sita, chani, inyuva nnottuna utheka chani wo mahuku mararu?” <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Nansho inupa yaarerihelha awe Yesu yaari iruttu awe. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Paahi etu vaahihimushiye awe ukhuma nnookhwani, owiittucha awe ahoopuwelha wiira aholhohera yayo, nkayaarumelhelha Malhove Matakatifu, yaahimianche awe Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noochuwelha mirima cha attu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Yesu vaari awe Uyerusalemu wo isikuukuu yo Pasaka, attu enchi yahorumelhelha nchina nawe yooneke cho ushangiha cheera awe wo uhimiechesha. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Nansho Yesu khaari ni nrima ni ayo ukhalhawaya ahaachuwelhacha onkhaye. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Khaarina nlhatu wo uhimiechesha uriyoothe, ukhalhawaya ahochuwelha rata chene chittu chonkhaye chiri munrimani mwaya.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ni Nanikodemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Ahaawo nholhelhi mmoka Ayahudi, o mphingo wa Amafarisayo, eehaniya Nanikodemo. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Nihuku nimoka Nanikodemo nkayaanrwelha Yesu uhiyu, ni umwiirelha, “Rabi, nihochuwelha wiira inyuva phi Owiittuchiha nrumiye ni Nlhuku. Khaawo ntu nooria upanga cho ushangiha chinopangacha inyu Nlhuku ahikhalheke vamoka ni uyo.” <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, ntu khanooria woona Umwene wa Nlhuku ahiyarieke tho.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nanikodemo nkayaakoha, “Ntu nkumi noorieke chani ukelha munthunkwani mwa anumwanawe, ni uyariya wo nayelhi?”<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, ntu ahiyarieke wo maashi ni wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku, ata veeriye chani khanooria ukelha Imwene ya Nlhuku. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Ntu noyaria wo iruttu wa athumwanawe ni anumwanawe, nansho noyaria munnepani wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Nhishange ukhalhawaya kihouhimeriani wiira ihophwanelhiya mwaattiva onkhaye vaa uyaria wo nayelhi. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Iphioo inowuka ni ukelha unothanana aya, nnowiiwa vanowuka aya, nansho khannochuwelha unokhumelhelha aya mena unokelhelha aya. Phiri aya thoko ntu yarelhe wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nanikodemo nkayankoha Yesu, “Yoyo mwaha uyo unoorieke chani?” <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Chani, inyuva ngati phi owiittuchiha attu o Uisraeli nhichuwelhe yoyo mwaha uyo? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, hiyaano ninohimiacha ichuwenlhe ihu ni uhimiechesha yonne ihu, nansho mwaattiva khannorumelhelha nttenga wihu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Akhalhaka kihouhimeriani mwaha wo velhaponi ni inyu khannokirumelhelha, nnorieke chani urumelhelha koohimeriakani mwaha wo wiirimu? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Khaawo ntu aapanche urwaa uchulhu wiirimu ahikhalhe Mwaana a Ntu, aakhuruwilhe ukhuma wiirimu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Thoko ashinna Musa vaatheshilhe aya nchulhu inwaa yo shaba vamwirini uthakoni ulhe, ni uyo Mwaana a Ntu nootheshiya nchulhu chiichammo, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />wiira kila ntu nonrumelhelha akhalhe ni ukumi wo uhimalha. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Nlhuku ahaattuna attu o velhaponi chinene, wo chiichammo etu, nkankumiha Mwaana awe o yekha, wiira riyoothe nonrumelhelha hipotere, nansho akhalhe ni ukumi wo uhimalha. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Nlhuku khanrumme Mwaana awe velhaponi awe aahukumulha attu, nansho oopolhe.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />“Attu onkhaye anonrumelhelha Mwaana khanohukumulhiya, ahinonrumelhelha ahomalha uhukumulhiya, ukhalhawaya kharumelhenlhe nchina no Mwaana a Nlhuku o yekha awe. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Ni ihukumu ene phi ilha, nthuko uhowa velhaponi, nansho attu anothanana ipiphi ahittunaka nthuko, ukhalhawaya chittu chinopangacha aya chiri cho uhilhoka. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Attu anopanga cho uhilhoka unowarusha nthuko ni ayo khanowa voonene, ukhalhawaya khanottuniha cho uhilhoka chaya chimwalhelhiye. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Nansho anovarechesha ikeekhene anoowa unthukoni, mitheko chaya chiwe chooniya chipangiaka wo unthimicha Nlhuku.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ni Nayohana Obatiiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Yamalhekeru, Yesu nkarwaa ilhapo yo Uyudea vamoka ni owiittucha awe, nkakhalhana wowo vamoka, ni attu aawa nkaabatiiziya. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Nayohana chiicho aari aabatiizaka attu Uainoni, iwani yaatameria Usalimu, ukhalhawaya wowo ahokhalha maashi menchi. Attu nkayanrweelha, ni ayo nkaabatiizacha. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Yeyo ikatema iyo Nayohana aari ahinaya uttukiya.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Owiittucha akina a Nayohana nkayaakhulhana ni Nyahudi mmoka wo mwaha wo malhemalhelho o khucha ikatema yo unthimicha Nlhuku. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Paahi etu, owiittucha ayo nkayaarwelha Nayohana ni weerelha, “Owiittuchiha, nnomuupuwelha yolhe ntu arina inyu vamoka ukhopelhelhe wo mwoolhoko wo Uyorodani ni inyuva nkamwanhimiechesha ulhe? Vano ni uyo nobatiiza, ni attu onkhaye anonrweelha!”<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Nayohana nkayaakhulha, “Ntu khanoria ukhalha ni ittu aahivahiyeke ni Nlhuku o wiirimu. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Ni inyu mwaashinene nnoworia uhimiechesha wiira kahohimia, ‘Miyaano kakihena Kuristo, nansho kirumiye wiira kinholhelhe!’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />A bibi arusi phi awaya abwana arusi, nansho anlhoko aya abwana arusi, aneemelha ni wiiwelhelha, anoshangarara chinene vaneewa aya abwana arusi yuulhumachaka. Phi chiicho ni mii ushangarara waka vanotimirihiya aya. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Yoyo phi phwanenlhe athepe ukhalha ochuwania chinene, ni miyaano kiwukuwe.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nowa ukhuma wiirimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Nowa ukhuma uchulhu phi mulhupalhe waapwaha onkhaye. Nokhuma velhaponi phi o ilhapo, olhumachaka mwaha wo velhaponi, nansho nowa ukhuma wiirimu phi mulhupalhe waapwaha onkhaye. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Yoyo yonne awe ni wiiwa ayo, phi o uhimiechesha, nansho khaawo ntu nottuna nttenga awe. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Nansho ntu riyoothe nottuna nttenga awe nohimiechesha wiira Nlhuku phi nohimiechesha ikeekhene. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Ulhe rumiye ni Nlhuku nohimiacha malhove a Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya Nlhuku nommaha yoyo ntu uyo Iphumu ya Nlhuku wo uhikhalha maphimelho. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Athithi anonttuna Mwaana ni ummaha ikuru chonkhaye mmathathani mwawe. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Attu anonrumelhelha Mwaana ahanaa ukumi wo uhimalha, attu ahinomwiiwelhelha Mwaana khanokhalha ni ukumi wo uhimalha, nansho anohalha muurushiyani mwa Nlhuku.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowaareriha ni Nsamariya nthiyana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Amafarisayo nkayeewa wiira Yesu nowaapatta owiittucha enchi ni wabatiiza waapwaha Nayohana. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Yesu mwanene khambatinze ntu, nansho owiittucha awe phi abatiiza attu. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Paahi etu Yesu veewilhe awe mwaha wolhumachiya, nkaathama Uyudea nkaahokolhia Ugalilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Vaari awe munkwahani mmo, nkaavirelha iwani yo Usamariya.<verse eid="JHN 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Wowo Usamariya uwo nkaaphiya Usukari, iwani yaatamenrie imata i Nayakhobo yaavanhe aya anaya, Nayusufu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Ilhushi i Nayakhobo yaari vavawo. Yeyo ikatema iyo yaari uthana variyari, ni Yesu aari noochelhe wo nkwaha, nkeettuwa vachereshere ilhushi.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Nthiyana mmoka Nsamariya nkaawa urikani maashi, Yesu nkaamwiirelha, “Nkivahe maashi kiwurie.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Yeyo ikatema iyo, owiittucha awe yaari anakelhanche umawani uuthumani yolhia.<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Nansho yoyo nthiyana uyo nkaamwiirelha Yesu, “Inyuva mwa Ayahudi, miyaano ki Nsamariya, nnooria chani ukivekelha mii maashi o wuria?” Olhumacha chiicho ukhalhawaya Ayahudi khayaari yaathanaka ni Asamariya.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu nkaakhulha, ikaari nchuwelhaka izawadi ya Nlhuku inothanana awe uuvahani, ni unchuwelha mpani nowiirelhani, “ ‘Nkivahe maashi kiurie’ mwaanonvekelha ni uyo anouvahani maashi anowiiha ukumi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Yoyo nthiyana uyo nkeera, “Pwiiya, inyuva khanrina indowo yo urikelha maashi ni ilhushi ene inarekamme. Nnaapatteke vayi maashi ari ni ukumi? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Athumwanihu Nayakhobo ni achishaana aya ni mihuwo chaya yaawuriacha vava.” Chani etu woonaka nneepanga ukhalha olhupalhe waapwaha yayo Nayakhobo ayo?<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Onkhaye anowuria alha maashi alha anowolhiya nttona tho, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />nansho ntu nohalha uwuria maashi anohalha aka ummaha mii, khanowolhiya nttona tho. Wo ikekhiaye, maashi anohalha aka ummaha, anowa ukhalha nrapo ninothekhuma maashi anowiiha ukumi. Ukumi wo mahuku o uhimalha.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Yoyo nthiyana uyo nkeera, “Pwiiya, nkakivaheni yayo maashi ayo! Kihoone nttona tho, mena kihiwe tho uurikani maashi vaa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu nkeera, “Nrwee mweehane owannyu mwaawane vaa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Nthiyana uyo nkaakhulha “Miyaano akirina alhopwana,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Yesu nkeera, “Nhohimia ikekheene wiira khanrina alhopwana. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Ukhalhawaya mwahothelhiya ni manyaalhopwana athanu, ni ayo nnaakhalhana inyu vano ayo kahena owaninyu. Vavawo nhohimia ikekhiaye.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Nthiyana uyo nkaamwiirelha Yesu, “Pwiiya, kinoona wiira inyuva phi anamilhohi. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Manyaapwiiya ihu anthimicha Nlhuku vachulhu ulha mwaako ulha, nansho mwaattiva Ayahudi va nnoniirelha wiira nipuro no unthimicha Nlhuku phi Uyerusalemu ulhe.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu nkaamwiirelha, “Maanyi nkirumelhelheke etu, mahuku anowa vahinowa inyu waathimicha Athithi vachulhu ulha mwaako ulha, mena Uyerusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Mwaattiva Asamariya va nnonthimicha ulhe nhinonchuwelha inyu. Nansho hii Ayahudi va ninonchuwelha ninonthimicha ihu, ukhalhawaya woopolhiya unchokholhelha wa Ayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Nansho mahuku anoowa ni ayo ahomalha uphiya, wo ikuru yo Iphumu ya Nlhuku, attu anowa waathimicha Athithi wo ikeekhene, ni waathimicha wo iphiro ye ikeekhene inothanana aya. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Nlhuku phi Iphumu. Chiichammo etu, attu anonthimicha anthananiya anthimicheke wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku ni ikeekhene thoko chiri awe.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Nthiyana uyo nkaahimia, “Kihochuwelha wiira Kuristo Moopolhi noowa. Vanohalha awe uwa, nonichuwelhiha chittu chonkhaye.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Mii kinoolhumacha ni inyuva va, phi Yoyo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Yeyo ikatema iyo owiittucha awe Yesu nkayaahokolhiacha, nkayaashangacha chinene umwoona aarerihaka ni nthiyana. Nansho khaawo ntu ankonhe nthiyana ulhe, “Nnothananani?” Ama unkoha Yesu, “Nnaarerihani ni alha?”<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Paahi etu nthiyana uyo nkaahiya mwaapu awe, nkaarwa umawani u waahimeriani attu, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Nkawaani mmwe mwaamona ntu kihimenrie mwaha kipangilhe aka wonkhaye. Chani khinooria wiira yoyo phi Kuristo Moopolhi?”<verse eid="JHN 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Attu nkayaathamacha mmawani nkayaarwaa uumwonani Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Yeyo ikatema iyo owiittucha awe yaari ampepechaka amwirelhaka, “Owiittuchiha, nlhieke yolhia!”<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Nansho Yesu nkeerelha, “Miyaano kihanaa yolhia nhinochuwelha inyu mwaattiva.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Owiittucha awe nkayaakohanacha ashineneru, “Chani hawo ntu ammwinhenre yolhia?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu nkeerelhacha, “Yoolhia aka iri phi uvara mitheko chaya alhe akirumme ni utimiriha chinothanana aya. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Mwaattiva nneera, ‘Chihohalha mieri micheshe, nlhaalha uphiye.’ Nansho miyaano kinouhimeriani wiira, mmweheke mmamatani chinre aya, cholhia chihaaya wo ukhunguriya! <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Ntu o ukhungura noolhiviya mahalha awe, athokoreriaka cholhia wo nlhatu no ukumi wo mahuku o uhimalha. Chiichammo etu ntu naalha ni ntu nokhungura anowa aashangarara vamoka. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu nna nuulhumo nna phi ikeekhene, ‘Mmoka phi naalha ni nkina nokhungura.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Miyaano kuurummeni wiira mwakhungure cholhia mmamatani mwahaalhimme inyu, akina phi alhimme, nansho mwaattiva nnopuha wo ntukutta naya.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Attu enchi o Usamariya yahonrumelhelha Yesu wo malhove aahimiechesha awe yoyo nthiyana uyo wiira, “Hokihimeria mwaha wonkhaye waapanga aka.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Attu o Usamariya nkayanrwelha Yesu, nkayanlhepelha wiira akhalhe vavawo. Nkaalhokelha wowo wo mahuku melhi.<verse eid="JHN 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Attu enchi akina nkayaarumelhelha nttenga wa Yesu, <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />nkayerelha athiyana alhe wiira, “Vano hii ninorumelhelha kuhiwe wo nlhatu no malhove inyu. Nansho niheewa naashinene, ni uchuwelha wiira we ikeekhene yolha ntu ulha phi Moopolhi o ilhapo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nonlhamiha mwaana a nholhelhi mmoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Avireke mahuku melhi, Yesu nkaathama wowo, nkaarwa Ugalilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Yesu aarwaa mwanene ukhalhawaya ahohimiechesha wiira, “Namilhohi khanothimichiya uwannyawe.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Aphiyeke Ugalilaya, attu yahompochera, ukhalhawaya ni ayo yaari Uyerusalemu uwo unlhiani Pasaka. Nkayoona chittu chonkhaye chaapanganche awe ikatema yo Pasaka iyo.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Yesu nkaahokolhia tho Ukaana ilhapo yo Ugalilaya waathathunshe awe maashi ukhalha idivai. Wowo ahaawo nholhelhi mmoka upuwani u Naherode, aari ni mwaana mmirawo nreta iwani yo Ukapenaumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Yoyo veewilhe awe wiira Yesu howa Ugalilaya ukhuma Uyudea, nkanrwelha ni unlhepelha wiira anttukane Ukapernaumu anlhamihe mwaana awe mmirawo aari nreta chinene. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesu nkaamwirelha, “Khaawo ntu nohalha urumelhelha aahoneke ithikineha ni cho ushangiha.”<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Yoyo nholhelhi uyo nkaakhulha, “Thithi, shontee, nngwee mwaana aka hinakhwa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu nkaamwirelha, “Nrweeke etu, mwaana inyu noolhama!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Yoyo ntu uyo nkaarumelhelha malhove a Yesu nkaarwa.<verse eid="JHN 4:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Vaari awe mphironi ahokolhiaka uwani, akarumiya awe nkayaawa ni unhimeria wiira, “Mwammirawo inyu nreta uyo holhama!”<verse eid="JHN 4:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Nkaakoherera ikatema ureta vanhiilhe aya mwaana, ni ayo nkayaakhulha, “Nchana uthana, ureta phi nhiyalhe aya.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Paahi etu athumwane mwaana ayo nkayoopuwelha wiira, yaari yelhe ikatema yaahimiye ni Yesu ilhe venre awe, “Mwaana inyu noolhama.” Vavawo etu yayo vamoka ni alhoko aya onkhaye, nkayanrumelhelha Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Ilha yaari yo ushangiha yo nayelhi yaapannge awe Yesu vaari awe akhumaka Uyudea alhukamaka Ugalilaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ulhamihiya ntu vanthapwini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Umalha wo yayo, Yesu nkaarwa Uyerusalemu wo isikuukuu ya Ayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Wowo Uyerusalemu uwo vanaatameria nlhako uneehaniya Nlhako wo Khondoro nihawo nthapwi nineehaniya wo Iebraniya Betizata, nthotho mwaya nikhalhaka ni ipwaro nthanu. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Areta enchi yaari akhalhachaka mmapwaroni mmo, attu ohoona, oremara ni attu oririyacha iruttu. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Yayo areta ayo yaari awehereraka wiira nnepa wo wiirimu wa Athithi ukhuruwe uwa ututuwanyihani maashi. Nreta aaholhelha ukelha munthapwini vanotutuwanyihiya aya maashi uyo, aholhama ikwerere iriyoothe yaarina awe. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Paahi ahaawo ntu mmoka vavawo awereiya ikwerere yo uririyacha iruttu iyaakha makhumi mararu ni nane. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesu ahomwoona yoyo ntu uyo narumpe vavawo, nkaachuwelha wiira hokhalha vavawo wo iyaakha chinchi, nkankoha, “Chani, nnoothanana ulhama?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Nreta uyo nkaakhulha, “Thithi, khakirina ntu o ukitumbucheriha munthapwini vanotutuwanihiya aya maashi, kila vanolhikacha aka ukelha mmaashini, ntu nkina nookiholhelha.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesu nkaamwiirelha ntu o uririyacha iruttu ulhe, “Wunkweke etu, ukusheke nttato nao nno weeteke, urweeke.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Wo uhipicha yoyo ntu uyo nkaalhama, nkaakusha nttato nawe, nkeeta.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Nihuku naapangelhe aya yoyo mwaha uyo, naari Nihuku no Wiittuwa, <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />wo chiichammo etu ahoolhelhi Ayahudi nkayaamwiirelha ntu aalhamihiye ulhe, “Lhelho Nihuku no Wiittuwa, Malhehero ihu anoochiichiha wiira khavanooria ukusha nttato ninyu.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Ntu ulhe nkaakhulha eeraka, “Yoyo ntu kilhaminhe uyo phi kiirenlhe, ‘Ukusheke nttato nao, weeteke, urweeke.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Ni ayo nkayankoha, “Phi mpani o wirenlheni nkusheke ntatto ninyu mweeteke, nrweeke?” <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Nansho aalhamihiye uyo khanchuwenlhe Yesu, ukhalhawaya wo nlhatu no uchara attu chinene, Yesu ahomalha ummwia nyerere. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Miholho aya, Yesu nkamphwanya ntu anlhaminhe awe u Inupa ya Nlhuku ulhe, nkeera, “Nholhama vano, nhiwonye tho, nhiwe mwaapatta yo hilhoka chinene.” <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Yoyo ntu uyo nkaarwa wa ahoolhelhi a Ayahudi ni waahimeria wiira Yesu phi nlhaminhe. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Paahi etu Ayahudi nkayaachokholhacha umvenga Yesu, wo nlhatu no nlhamiha ntu Nihuku no Wiittuwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yesu nkaakhulha eeraka, “Athumwanaka arii munthekoni, phi chiichammo ni mii kihophwanelhiya upanga mitheko.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Nenno nlhove nno etu, nkanaathepiha ahoolhelhi a Ayahudi waavia iphiro yo mwiiva Yesu, kuhena wo nlhatu nohithimicha Malhehero yo Nihuku no Wiittuwa. Nansho ukhalhawaya aahowulhumacha wiira Nlhuku phi Athumwanawe, ni wilhikaaniha ni Nlhuku.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikuru yo Mwaana a Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu nkaakhulha Ayahudi eeraka, “Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, Mwaana khanooria upanga ittu mwanene, nopanga ilhe noona awe Athumwanawe apangaka. Inopanga aya Athumwanawe, Mwaana phi nopanga awe chiicho. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Ukhalhawaya Athithi anonttuna Mwaana, ni umwooniha chittu chonkhaye chinopanga aya anene, amwoonihaka chittu chulhupalhe upwaha chii cho nlhamiha ntu chii, ni inyu nnowa ushanga chinene. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Thoko Athithi chinaahihimusha aya attu akhwilhe ni waavaha ukumi, phi chiichammo etu Mwaana ni uyo nowaavaha ukumi anaattuna awe. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Athithi khanonhukumulha ntu riyoothe. Mwaana phi vahiye ikuru yonkhaye yo waahukumulha attu, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />yiireke wiira attu onkhaye anthimicheke Mwaana thoko chinaathimicha aya Athithi. Ntu hinonthimicha Mwaana khanaathimicha Athithi anrumme.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Ikekhiaye kinouhimeriani, aneewa malhove aka ni waarumelhelha akirumme, anoopatta ukumi wo uhimalha. Yayo khanohukumulhiya, nansho ahomalha uvira nnookhwani ni ukelha mu ukumini mwo uhimalha. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Ikekhiaye kinouhimeriani, mahuku anowa, ni ayo ahomalha uwa, akhwilhe vanowa aya wiiwacha nlhove na Mwaana a Nlhuku, ni ayo anottuna wiiwa ayo anokhalha akumi. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Thoko Athithi chiri aya machokholhelho o ukumi, phi chiichammo etu chinvahe aya Mwaana ukhalha machokholhelho o ukumi. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Tho ahommaha Mwaana ikuru yo uhukumulha, ukhalhawaya yoyo phi Mwaana a Ntu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Nhuumiye uwanoni, mahuku anowa onkhaye ari mmahiyeni vanowa aya wiiwacha nlhove nawe <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />ni uhihimmwa mmahiyeni. Alhe apangilhe chorera anohihimmwa ni ukhalha akumi, ni alhe aapannge cho uhilhoka anowa uhihimmwa ni uhukumulhiya.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />“Miyaano khakinooria upanga ittu wo ikuru aka kimwanene, Kinohukumulha thoko chineeraka wo uhimeriya ni Athithi, ni iyo ihukumu aka phi yo ikekhiaye, ukhalhawaya akinolhikacha upanga ittu kinothanana aka, nansho chinothanana aya akirumme.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikeekhene inohimiechesha ikuru ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />“Keehimiecheshaka mii kimwanene, uhimiechesha waka khunooria urumelhelhiya wiira we ikeekhene. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Nansho hawo nkina nokihimiechesha mii, ni miyaano kihochuwelha wiira chonkhaye chinohimia awe akiromolhaka phi ikeekhene. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Mwahaaruma attu urweeha nttenga wo ukikoherera u Nayohana, ni ayo ahohimiechesha ikeekhene. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Uhimiechesha wa attu kuhii unokhulhuvelha aka, nansho kinohimiacha alha malhove alha wiira mwoopolhiye. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Nayohana yaari thoko nthuko waamwalhelha nkwee, ni inyu mwaatti wo mahuku vakani nkamwaattapelhelha yoyo nthuko uyo. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Nansho miyaano kihanaa malhove kinohimiechesha aka arii molhupalhe upwaha malhove a Nayohana. Ukhalhawaya mitheko kinopanga aka, phi mitheko akivanhe aya Athithi wiira kipange, ni chechiyo phi nokihimiechesha wiira Athithi phi kirumme. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Ni ayo Athithi akirumme, phi nokihimiechesha. Mwaattiva khannapacha wiiwa nlhove naya, mena woona ikhove aya, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />ni inyu khannarumelhelha nlhove naya munrimani mwinyu, ukhalhawaya nhokhota unrumelhelha nrumme aya. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Mwaattiva nnooshoma Malhove Matakatifu mwaanyiheraka wiira mwommo, nnoophwanya ukumi wo uhimalha. Nansho yayo Malhove ayo phi nokihimiechesha mii! <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Inakhalhaka chiicho, mpaka nna mwaattiva khannottuna uwa uwannyaka mmwe mwaapatta ukumi uhinomalha.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Nnikwa aka khurii upatta nthimicho unokhuma wa attu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Nansho kihoochuwelhani mwaatti wiira, unttuna Nlhuku khuuwo mu nrimani mwinyu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Miyaano kiwiilhe wo ikuru ya Athithi, ni inyu khannakipochera, nansho attu akina yawaaka wo ikuru chaya ashinene, nnowaapochera. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Mwaattiva nnothanana upochera nthimicho winyu mwaashineneru, nhaaviaka upatta nthimicho ukhuma wa uyo ri vekha, Nlhuku, nnoorieke chani etu ukirumelhelha? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Nhaanyihere wiira miyaano phi nowa kaahimiacha milhatu chinyu wa Athithi. Ashinna Musa, mweshenre inyu nikhulhuvelho ninyu, yayo phi nowa uhimiachani milhatu chinyu. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Yakaari mwahaarumelhelha ashinna Musa, mwaanokirumelhelha ni mii, ukhalhawaya ashinna Musa yaholhepa malhove anokaacha mii.<verse eid="JHN 5:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />“Nansho yakhalhaka wiira khamwaarumelhenlhe Malhehero yaalhepiye ni ashinna Musa, nnoorieke chani urumelhelha malhove aka?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowaalhiha attu maelufu nthanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mak 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Umalhawaya, Yesu nkaalhapuwa nttiya no Ugalilaya ama nttiya no Utiberiya. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Nlhoko mulhupalhe wa attu nkawanttwara, nlhatu no woona cho ushangiha chaari awe apangaka ni waalhamiha areta. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Yesu nkaawelha umwaakoni, nkaakhalha vamoka ni owiittucha awe. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Isikuukuu ya Ayahudi yo Pasaka yaari inaatamenrie. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yesu apathusheke miitho, nkoona nlhoko mulhupalhe wa attu ummweelhaka. Nkaakoha Nafilipo, “Ninaathumeke vayi yolhia yowaalhiha attu alha?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Yesu olhumanche chiicho wo waalhikacha Nafilipo, ukhalhawaya ahochuwelha mwanene chowiira.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Nafilipo nkayaakhulha, “Ninathumaka mikatte cho idinari imia pilhi chirina ihu khachimmwanelha waalhiha inakhalhaka vakani alha attu enchi alha.”<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Owiittucha awe mmoka, Naandorea, nhima aya Nasimoni Peturo, nkaamwiirelha, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Hawo vaa mmirawo mmoka rina mikatte nthanu cho shayiri ni ihopa pilhi. Nansho khachinowanelha wa attu enchi thoko alha.”<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu nkeera, “Mwaakalhiheke etu attu ayo vathi.” Manyashi aari menchi vavawo vakittu vawo. Paahi etu attu nkayaakhalha vathi, alhopwana vekha aya aphiyelhaka attu maelufu nthanu. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yesu nkaakusha mikatte chilhe, nkanthimicha Nlhuku, nkaakawelha attu yaakhalhanche. Ni ihopa chiyo nkeera chiicho, kila ntu nkaapatta chaathananne awe. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Attu vaawonne aya Yesu nkeerelha owiittucha awe, “Nrokottacheke mikatte chihanlhe chiyo chihipotere.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Nkayaakhupacha mahalhahalha aahanlhe, nkayaachariha makaya khumi ni melhi.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Attu yooneke yeyo yo ushangiha yaapangilhe awe Yesu iyo, nkayeeracha, “Wo ikekhiaye yolha phi namilhohi aaphwanelhiye uwa velhaponi!” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesu nkaachuwelha wiira attu yaari athananaka ummara umwene, nkaathama tho, nkaarwa umwaakoni vekha awe.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noweeta vachulhu maashi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-23">Mat 14:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mak 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Waphiyeke uchechilho owiittucha awe nkayaakhuruwa urwaa unttiyani, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />nkayaawelhacha nkalhavani, alhapuwaka urwaa Ukapenaumu. Ipiphi yaari inakenlhe, ni Yesu aari hinaapiyelha. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Nttiya nkanaachokholha ututuwana nlhatu no iphioo yaawuka wo machiri. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Owiittucha vaaphilhe aya nkwaha wo maili nthanu ama sita, nkayaamoona Yesu eetaka vachulhu maashi, aatameriaka ikalhava, nkayoovacha chinene. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Yesu nkeerelha, “Phi mii, nhoovache!” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Nkayaathanana unkusha Yesu nkalhavani, ni ikalhava yaari inaphiilhe ukhopelhelhe nttiya waalhukama aya.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Attu anoomwaavia Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Waashelhe waya nlhoko wa attu yaahanlhe ukhopelhelhe nttiya nkawaachuwelha wiira ikalhava ikina yaahanlhe wowo. Ni ayo nkayoopuwelha wiira Yesu khaawenlhe nkalhavani vamoka ni owiittucha awe, owiittucha ayo yaarwachilhe vekha aya. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Tho, ikalhava chikina ukhuma Utiberiya chahowa vavawo vakittu vawo attu vaalhilhie aya mikatte, Athithi vaamanlhe aya unthimicha Nlhuku. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Attu ayo yachuwelheke wiira Yesu ni owiittucha awe khayariwo vavawo, nkayaawelhacha nkalhavani nkayaarwaa umwaaviani Ukapenaumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu phi nkatte wo ukumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Nkayamphwanya Yesu ukhopelhelhe nttiya nkayankoha, “Owiittuchiha, mwaawiilhe yaakhani vaa?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, khannokaavia wo nlhatu no woona yo ushangiha iyo, nansho ukhalhawaya mwaaholhia mikatte chilhe nkamwaawona. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Nhichenjeukelhe yolhia inochukumana, nchenjeukelheke yolhia ihinochukumana yo ukumi wo uhimalha. Yoyo phi Mwaana a Ntu, ukhalhawaya Athithi, Nlhuku ahonthanlha ni unhimiechesha wiira noowa uvahani yeyo yolhia iyo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Ni ayo nkayankohacha, “vano niireke chani etu, ni hii noorie upanga chinothanana awe Nlhuku?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ntheko unothanana awe Nlhuku wiira mpange, uri unrumelhelha ntu nrumilhe aya.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Vavawo nkayankoha, “Unohalha upanga yo ushangiha yaani noone nuurumelhelhe? Unohalha upangani? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Ashulhupalhe ihu yaholhia yolhia yaakhumme wiirimu yeehaniya imana uuthakhoni ulhe, thoko Malhove Matakatifu vaneera aya wiira, ‘Ahaalhiha nkatte waakhumme wiirimu.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu nkeera, “Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, ashinna Musa kahiwe ovanheni nkatte wo wiirimu, nansho Athumwanaka phi nouvahani mwaattiva nkatte we ikeekhene unokhuma wiirimu. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Ukhalhawaya nkatte wa Nlhuku nnovahiya inyu phi uyo nokhuruwa ukhuma wiirimu ni uwiiha ukumi wa attu o velhaponi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Paahi nkayaamwiirelha, “Thithi, nkanivaheni yoyo nkatte uyo mahuku onkhaye.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesu nkeera, “Miyaano phi yolhia inouvahani ukumi. Nokiweelha khanowolhiya ithalha tho, nokirumelhelha khanowolhiya nttona tho. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Vano etu, kahouhimeriani wiira nnookona nansho khannokirumelhelha. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Ntu riyoothe anokivaha aya Athithi nookiweelha, ni mii khakinonkhota ntu nokiweelha, <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />ukhalhawaya khakiwiilhe ukhuma wiirimu kiwe kaapanga chinothanana aka mii, nansho chinothanana aya Athithi akirumme. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Ni iyo anothanana aya akirumme iri wiira, kihinrihe hata mmoka akivanhe aya, nansho kiwe kanhihimusha ni ummaha ukumi wo uhimalha nihuku no umalha ilhapo. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Ittu inothanana aya Athithi phi ilha, attu onkhaye anomwona Mwaana ni unrumelhelha, akhalhe ni ukumi wo uhimalha. Ni mii kinowaahihimusha nihuku no umalha ilhapo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Ayahudi nkayaarushiya, nlhatu Yesu aahowiira, “Miyaano phi nkatte ukhuruwilhe ukhuma wiirimu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Nkayeeracha, “Ana ulha ntu ulha kahiwe Yesu, mwaana a Nayusufu? Nihaachuwelha athumwanawe ni anumwanawe. Chani, vano, neera wiira khuruwilhe ukhuma wiirimu?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Nkahiyani uchukulha mwaashineneru. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Khaawo ntu nowa uwannyaka aahiwihiyeke ni Athithi akirumme mii, ni mii kinonhihimusha nihuku no umalha ilhapo. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Anamilhohi aholhepa wiira, ‘Kila ntu nowiittuchihiya ni Nlhuku.’ Kila ntu neewelhelha Athithi, ni wiittucha uwannyaya yoyo nowa uwannyaka. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Kineera wiira, khaawo ntu riyoothe panche woona Athithi, yoyo khumme wa Nlhuku uyo vekha awe phi onne Athithi. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Kinouhimeriani ikekhiaye wiira, ntu norumelhelha, yoyo hanaa ukumi wo mahuku o uhimalha. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Mii phi nkatte ummwiha ukumi. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Manyaapwiiya inyu aholhia imana uthakoni, nansho yahokhwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Nansho nkatte unowa ukhuma wiirimu phi nolhikaana wiira ntu riyoothe nolhia khanokhwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Mii phi nkatte wo ukumi unowa ukhuma wiirimu. Ntu alhiaka yolha nkatte ulha yoyo khanokhwa, nookhalha nkumi mahuku o uhimalha. Ni uyo ukhalhaka iruttu aka, kinokumiha aka wiira ilhapo ihimalhe.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Yoyo mwaha uyo nkawaawiha waakhulhaniya mwa Ayahudi ashineneru. Waari ukohaniyaka, “Noorieke chani ulha ntu ulha univaha iruttu awe nilhie?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yesu nkeerelha, “Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, mwaahilhieke iruttu ya Mwaana a Ntu ni uwuria iphome awe, khannopatta ukumi. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Onkhaye anolhia iruttu aka ni uwuria iphome aka ahana ukumi wo mahuku o uhimalha, ni mii kinowa kaahihimusha muukumini nihuku noomalha ilhapo. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Yakhalhaka wiira iruttu aka phi yolhia ye ikeekhene, ni iphome aka etu phi yo wuria ye ikeekhene. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Attu onkhaye anolhia iruttu aka ni uwuria iphome aka anookhalha nhina mwaka, ni mii kinookhalha nhina mwaya. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Athithi ari akumi ahokiruma mii, ni mii kinokhalha wo nlhatu waya. Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu, ntu nokilhia mii noolhama wo nlhatu naka mii. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Vano etu, nkatte unkhuma wiirimu, khunolhikaana ni nkatte waalhilhie aya manyaapwiiya inyu uthakoni. Aholhia nkaakhwa, nansho anolhia ulha nkatte ulha khanokhwa anookhalha akumi mahuku no uhimalha.”<verse eid="JHN 6:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesu olhumanche yayo vaari awe eettuchihaka mu inupa yo unlhapelha Nlhuku Ukapenaumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malhove anowiiha ukumi wo mahuku o uhimalha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Owiittucha awe enchi veewilhe aya nkayeera, “Alha meettuchiho alha arii orikarika chinene. Apani anohalha wiiwelhelha?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yesu nkaachuwelha ichuku cha owiittucha wo uhihimeriya ni ntu, paahi etu nkeera, “Chani nhokelhiya nipampa? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Inottuna ukhalha chani etu vanowa inyu umoona Mwaana a Ntu arwaaka nchulhu waari awe? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Nnepa wa Nlhuku phi nowiiha ukumi, ikuru cha ntu chihikhalhaka ittu. Malhove kuulhumachilhe aka phi nommwiiha Iphumu ya Nlhuku nowiiha ukumi. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Inakhalhaka chiicho ahawo akina inyu ahinokirumelhelha.” Yesu oolhumacha chiicho ukhalhawaya ahaachuwelha ahinonrumelhelha ni ntu nohalha unthumiha. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Nkoncherera eeraka, “Yolha phi nlhatu no uhimeriani wiira khaawo ntu nohalha uwa uwannyaka aahorihiyeke ni Athithi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu, owiittucha enchi anttwarattwara Yesu, nkayaarukunuwa utulhi ni uhinttwara tho. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Paahi etu Yesu nkaakoha owiittucha awe khumi ni elhi alhe eeraka, “Ni inyu mwaatti, chani khannokittwara?”<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Nasimoni Peturo nkayaakhulha, “Thithi, nirweeke wa apani tho? Inyuva phi ri ni malhove o univaha ukumi wo mahuku o uhimalha. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Ni hii vano nihorumelhelha ni uchuwelha wiira, inyu phi ntakatifu rumiye ni Nlhuku.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Kahoothanlhani mwaatti khumi ni elhi, ngati? Nansho mmoka inyu, yoyo nakare!” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Vavawo aari amwaachaka Yuda, mwaana a Nasimoni Isikariote, ukhalhawaya Yuda phi akelha unthumiha, inakhalhaka aari mmoka aya owiittucha khumi ni elhi alhe.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ni ashihima awe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Umalhawaya yayo, Yesu aari munkwahani alhukamaka Ugalilaya, khaathananne weetakacha ilhapo yo Uyudea ukhalhawaya ahoolhelhi Ayahudi yaari athananaka umwiiva. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Nihuku no Isikuukuu ya Ayahudi yo Marapatta naari ninaatamenrie, <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Yesu nkeerelhiya ni ashihima awe wiira, “Nthameke vaa nrweeke Uyudea, owiittucha inyu yooneke mitheko chinyu. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Ntu khanovitha chinopanga awe akhalhaka wiira nothanana uchuwania mwaattuni. Ukhalhawaya nnopanga cho ushangiha, mpangeke etu ilhapo yonkhaye ichuwelheke!” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Ata ashihima awe khayanrumelhenlhe.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesu nkeera, “Ikatema aka kinaphiya. Nansho mwaattiva va kila ikatema inouphwanelhani. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Ilhapo khiinooria uuvengani mwaattiva, nansho miyaano inookivenga ukhalhawaya mii kinohimiechesha wiira mitheko chaya chiri cho uhilhoka. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Mwaattiva nrweeke etu u sikuukuuni uwo. Miyaano khakinorwaa, ukhalhawaya ikatema aka yo ulhoka khinaphiya.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Nkoolhumacha yayo malhove ayo, nkaahalha Ugalilaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nihuku no isikuukuu yo marapatta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Ashihima awe yamalheke urwaa u sikuukuuni, Yesu ni uyo nkaarwa, nansho khaarweelhe wo wiichooniha, aarweelhe wo wiivitha. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Aholhelhi Ayahudi yaari amwaaviaka va sikuukuuni vawo, nkayaakoha, “Ri vayi?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Malhove menchi o waapiya nkayeewiya mwaattuni. Attu akina nkayeera, “Ntu orera nrima.” Akina nkayeera, “Mena! Nowiiraka waathwelhelhiha attu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Nansho khaawo ntu aalhikanche wulhumacha mwaha wawe voonene wo woova ahoolhelhi Ayahudi.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Isikuukuu yaari inaphiyenlhe variyari, Yesu vaarwelhe awe u Inupa ya Nlhuku ni uchokholha weettuchiha attu. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Aholhelhi Ayahudi nkayaashanga chinene ni wiira, “Ulha ntu ulha pantte vayi irusho ni uyo khanashoma?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Meettuchiho kineettuchiha aka kahiwe awaka, nansho awawe Nlhuku kirumme. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Ntu nopanga chinothanana awe Nlhuku, noochuwelha wiira meettuchiho aka akhumme wa Nlhuku, ama miyaano kinoolhumacha wo ikuru aka kimwanene. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Ntu noolhumacha wo ikuru awe mwanene naavia nthimicho wawe mwanene. Nansho naavia nthimicho wa ntu nrumme, yoyo ri o ikekhiaye, hinanaraka variwoothe. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Chani, ashinna Musa khayovanheni Malhehero? Nansho khaawo hata mmoka inyu novara Malhehero. Nlhatu waani nnothanana ukiiva?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Attu nkayaamwaakhulha, “Nrii ni nshoka no unanara inyu ayi! Apani anothanana uwiivani?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Kahopanga yo ushangiha imoka, ni inyu onkhaye nkamwaashanga. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Ashinna Musa yaholheherani weenelha achishaana inyu, inakhalhaka wiira ashinna Musa kahena aachokhonlhe, nansho manyaapwiiya inyu phi achokhonlhe. Alha mahuku, mwaattiva nnoomwinelha unyawo mwanhima nlhopwana hata Nihuku no Wiittuwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Yakhalhaka etu mwanhima nowiinelhiya unyawo hata Nihuku no Wiittuwa wiira Malhehero a ashinna Musa ihiwonyiye, woonaka nnokithunalhelha wo nlhatu no nlhamiha ntu Nihuku no Wiittuwa? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Nhihukumulhe chittu wo vathe, nhukumulheke we ikekhiaye.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Chani ulha phi Kuristo?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Attu akina o Uyerusalemu nkayeera, “Chani, ntu naaviya wiira eeviye ulhe kahena ulha? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Mwooneke vano! Noolhumacha voonene, mena khaawo ntu nonvaanyiha! Chani, inowooria ahoolhelhi ahochuwelha ikeekhene wiira ulha phi Kuristo? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Nansho Kuristo vanohalha awe uwa khaawo ntu nottuna uchuwelha vakittu vanowa awe ukhumelhelha. Nansho hiyaano nihochuwelha ukhumelhenlhe awe ulha ntu ulha!”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Yesu vaari awe eettuchihaka u Inupa ya Nlhuku nkaakhuwelha eeraka, “Eti nnera wiira nnookichuwelha, ni uchuwelha ukhumme aka? Mii khakiwilhe wo ikuru aka kimwanene. Yayo akirumme miyaano ayo, phi o ikekhiaye. Mwaattiva khannaachuwelha, <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />nansho miyaano kinowaachuwelha ukhalhawaya kikhumme uwannyaya, ni ayo phi kirumme.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Attu nkayaalhikacha ummara ni unttuka, nansho khaawo ntu okonlhe moono ummara ukhalhawaya isaa awe yaari ihinaphiya. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Attu enchi munlhokoni mwa attu alhe yahonrumelhelha, nkayeera, “Chani, Kuristo awaaka noowa aapanga cho ushangiha chulhupalhe chinene uthepa chipangilhe awe ulha?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Manyaasikari anorumiya ummara Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Amafarisayo nkayeewa attu yaapaka mwaha wa Yesu. Paahi amafarisayo vamoka ni opochera ishaani olhupalhe nkayaaruma manyaasikari ammare Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yesu nkeera, “Kinoolhokelha ni inyu wo mahuku vakani, yamalhaka kinoorwaa wo ayo akirumme. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Nnookavia nansho khannokoona, ukhalhawaya mwaattiva khannooria uphiya wowo.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Aholhelhi Ayahudi nkayeerelhana ashineneru, “Ulha ntu ulha naarweeke vayi vahinooria ihu umpatta? Naarweeke wa Ayahudi awanenlhe ilhapo ya Ayunani, ni weettuchiha Ayunani? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Iri ni maana ani vaneera awe, ‘Nnookaavia nansho khannokipatta, vanottuna aka ukhalha mwaattiva khannooria uphiya?’ ”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nrapo no maashi o ukumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Nihuku noomalhelha yeyo isikuukuu iyo naari nihuku no yekha aya, Yesu nkeemelha ni wulhumacha wo nlhove nulhupalhe eeraka, “Ntu nowolhiya nttona aweeke uwannyaka, <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />ntu nokirumelhelha nowa aawuria. Thoko Malhove Matakatifu chinohimia aya, ‘Ntu nokirumelhelha mii, marapo o maashi anowiiha ukumi anothekhuma munrimani mwawe!’ ” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Yesu olhumanche chiicho amwaachaka Iphumu ya Nlhuku, nottuna aya umpochera alhe attu anrumelhenlhe ayo. Yeyo ikatema iyo Iphumu ya Nlhuku aari hinawa ukhalhawaya Yesu aari hinaya upochera nthimicho wawe.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umwalhaana wa attu wo nlhatu na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Attu akina mwaattuni mmo nkayaamwiwa olhumachaka yayo malhove ayo, nkayeera, “Wo ikekhiaye ulha ntu ulha phi Namilhohi!”<verse eid="JHN 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Akina aya nkayeera, “Ulha phi Kuristo Moopolhi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Nansho akina tho nkayeera, “Kuristo Moopolhi khaanooria ukhuma Ugalilaya! <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Malhove Matakatifu aneera wiira, Kuristo naakhumeke iyari ya Amwene Adaudi, ni uyaria Ubethelehemu, iwani yaakhalha aya Adaudi!” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Paahi mwaha wa Yesu nkawaamwalhaaniha attu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Attu akina athananaka unttuka, nansho khaawo ammanre.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uhirumelhelha wa Aholhelhi Ayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Manyaasikari yahokolhieke, nkayaakohiya ni opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni Amafarisayo, “Chani woonaka khannammanra ni ummwiiha?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Manyaasikari nkayaakhulha, “Khaawo ntu o wooria wulhumacha thoko chinoolhumacha awe ulha ntu ulha!”<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Amafarisayo nkayaakoha, “Chani, ni inyu mwaatti chiicho nhothepiya? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Chani ahawo anakhalhaka mmoka a ahoolhelhi a attu, ama mmoka a Amafarisayo anrumelhenlhe? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Ulha nlhoko ulha khuchuwenlhe Malhehero a ashinna Musa, paahi etu uholhaviya ni Nlhuku!”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Mmoka a Amafarisayo aari Nanikodemo yanrweenlhe Yesu mahuku avinre alhe. Paahi, yayo nkayeerelha akhunanaya wiira, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Wo ulhikaana ni Malhehero ihu khaninooria unhukumulha ntu nihinaaya umwiiwelhelha ni uchuwelha ttenkeni.”<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Ni ayo nkayaamwakhulha, “Chani ni inyuva chiicho nnokhuma Ugalilaya? Nrweeke mwashomeke Malhove Matakatifu etu ni inyu nnokooshoma wiira, khaawo namilhohi nohalha ukhuma Ugalilaya.” <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Paahi attu onkhaye nkayaahokolhiacha mmawannyaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Nthiyana aavariye muulhuvani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Kila ntu nkaahokolhia uwannyawe, nansho Yesu nkaarwa waari Mwaako wo Mizeituni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Wichishuru waashelhe waya nkaarwa tho u Inupa ya Nlhuku. Attu onkhaye nkayanrukureriacha, nkaakhalha ni uchokholha wettuchiha. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Owiittuchiha Malhehero a ashinna Musa ni Amafarisayo nkayammwiiha nthiyana mmoka aaphwanyeriye muulhuvani, nkayaamwemesha variyari aya. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Nkayaamwiirelha Yesu, “Owiittuchiha! Ulha nthiyana ulha hophwanyeriya alhuvaka. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Malhehero ihu ya ashinna Musa yahoniruma wiira nthiyana thoko ulha awonyeriye malhuku mpaka akhwe. Paahi etu inyuva nneera chani?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />olhumacha chiicho wo unria, apatte nlhatu wo umwirelha wiira hotteka. Nansho Yesu nkooroma, nkaakheria vathi ni nikokho nawe.<verse eid="JHN 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Yathepeke unkoha, Yesu nkennuwa nkeerelha, “Ntu riyoothe hinawonya munkwahani mwinyu, yoyo awonyeke nlhuku no upacha.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Nkooroma tho, nkaakheria tho vathi vattayani. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Veewilhe aya chiicho, nkayaachokholha uthama mmokammoka, aholhelhaka ashulhupalhe. Yesu nkaahiya yeekha awe ni athiyana alhe aahanlhe aneemenlhe. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yesu vennuwilhe awe nkaakoha athiyana ayo, “Ari vayi attu ayo? Khaawo hata mmoka hanlhe ohukumulheni?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Nthiyana uyo nkaakhulha, “Thithi, khaawo inakhalhaka mmoka!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Yesu nkeera, “Mena miyaano khakinoohukumulhani. Nrweeke, nansho nhiwonye tho.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu phi nthuko wo ilhapo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yesu nkoolhumacha weerelha Amafarisayo tho. “Miyaano phi nthuko wo ilhapo, ntu nokittwara mii nookhalha ni nthuko wo ukumi, khaneeta mwiipiphini.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Amafarisayo nkayaamwirelha, “Inyuva nnehimiacha mwaanene, uhimiechesha winyu kuhiwe we ikekhiaye.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Anakhalhaka kineehimiechesha kimwanene, uhimiechesha waka urii we ikeekhene ukhalhawaya miyaano kihochuwelha ukhumme aka ni uwo unokelha aka. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Mwaattiva nnohukumulha wo irusho cha attu, nansho miyaano khakinonhukumulha ntu. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Uhukumulha waka, urii we ikeekhene ukhalhawaya miyaano khakirii vekha aka, Athithi akirumme arii vamoka ni mii. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Iholhepiya nhina Malhehero inyu wiira uhimiechesha wa attu elhi weewananaka, inohimia aya phi ikeekhene. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Miyaano kineehimiacha kimwanene, ni ayo Athithi akirumme, anookihimiechesha chiicho.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Vavawo nkayankoha, “Athumwaninyu ayo ari vayi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Yesu nkaakhulha, “Mwaattiva khannokichuwelha mii mena khannaachuwelha Athumwanaka. Yakhalhaka mwaanokichuwelha mii, mwaanachuwelha ni Athumwanaka.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu olhumanche yayo malhove ayo u Inupa ya Nlhuku, nchuumbani mwo nikhupi no ushungiya nchurukhu vaari awe ettuchihaka. Mena khaawo ntu ammanre, ukhalhawaya isaa awe yaari ihinaphiya.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Unokelha aka mwaattiva khannooria uphiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesu nkeera tho, “Kinoorwaa, ni inyu nnookaavia, nansho nnookhwa mu uwonyani winyu. Unokelha aka mii, mwaattiva khannooria urwaa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Aholhelhi Ayahudi nkayeera, “Chani, nowichiiva? Woonaka neera, ‘Unokelha aka mwaattiva khannooria uphiya?’ ”<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Mwaattiva nkhumme vava vathi vaa, miyaano kikhumme wiirimu uchulhu, mwaattiva o velhaponi va, miyaano kakihiwe o velhaponi va. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Phi nlhatu no uwirelhani wiira nnookhwa mu uwonyani winyu. Paahi wo ikekhiaye, mwaahirumelhelheke etu wiira ‘Miyaano phi Yoyo,’ nnookhwa mu uwonyani winyu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Ni ayo nkayankoha, “Inyuva phi apani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Yesu nkaakhulha, “Kihoohimeriani ukhuma khalhayi! <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Kihanaa menchi o wulhumacha ni uhukumulhani. Nansho akirumme mii ayo phi ikeekhene, ni mii kinohimiacha wa attu o velhaponi mwaha kiiwalhe aka uwannyaya.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Khayachuwenlhe wiira Yesu olhumacha mwaha wa Athithi. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Yesu nkeerelha, “Vanottuna inyu umwiinulha Mwaana a Ntu, vavawo nnowa mwaachuwelha wiira ‘Miyaano phi Yoyo,’ ni wiira khakinopanga iriyoothe miyaano kimwanene, nansho kinoolhumacha wo ikuru ivahiye ni Athithi wiira kuulhumache. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Akirumme arii vamoka ni mii mahuku onkhaye, yayo khanakihiya vekha ukhalhawaya chinopanga aka chinowateelhiha nrima.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Attu enchi yaamwiwilhe Yesu olhumachaka yahonrumelhelha.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwaana a Nlhuku nouhiyererani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yesu nkeerelha Ayahudi anrumelhenlhe alhe wiira, “Mwarumelhelhaka meettuchiho aka, nnookhalha owiittucha aka we ikekhiaye. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Vavawo nnochuwelha ikekheene, ni iyo inouvahani uneethi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Ni ayo nkayaamwaakhulha, “Hiyaano phi iyari ya Aburahimu, nihipachaka ukhalha akavihi a ntu riyoothe. Wo nlhatu waani nneera, ‘Nnohiyereriya?’ ”<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, kila ntu nowonya phi ipotta yo uwonya. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Ipotta khirina ikuru yo lhokelha vawani, nansho mwaana hanaa ikuru yo ulhokelha mahuku onkhaye. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Mwaana ohiyererakani, nnohiyereriya wo ikekhiaye. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Kihochuwelha wiira mwaattiva phi iyari ya Aburahimu. Nansho anakhalhaka chiicho, nnothanana ukiiva ukhalhawaya khannorumelhelha meettuchiho aka. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Miyaano kinohimiacha chilhe chikoonihilhe aya Athithi, nansho mwaattiva nnopanga chilhe chihimeriye inyu ni athumwaninyu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Ayo nkayaamwakhulha, “Athumwanihu phi Aburahimu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Yesu nkaakhulha, “Thoko mwaattiva mwakaari ashaana a Aburahimu, mwampanga thoko chaapanga aya. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Miyaano kihoohimeriani ikeekhene ya Nlhuku, nansho anakhalhaka chiicho, mwaattiva nnothanana ukiiva. Aburahimu khayaapannge chiicho! <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Mwaattiva nnopanga mwaha thoko yoolhe waapanga aya athumwaninyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Ayo nkayaamwirelha, “Hiyaano kanihiwe ashaana niyariye muulhuvani! Nihanaa Athithi amoka tu, Nlhuku.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu nkeera, “Ikaari wiira Nlhuku phi Athumwaninyu, mwaanokittuna miyaano, ukhalhawaya miyaano kikhumme wa Nlhuku ni vano kirii vaa. Khakiwilhe wo ikuru aka kimwanene, nansho yayo phi kirumilhe. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Woonaka khannochuwelha yayo malhove kinoolhumacha aka ayo? Ukhalhawaya khanneewelhelha nttenga aka. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Mwaattiva phi ashaana a Nakare, nttwarattwaraka nikakata na athumwaninyu. Toka machokholhelho yayo arii owiiva ahikhalhaka mu ikekhiani, ukhalhawaya ikeekhene khiiwo nhina mwaya. Kila vanolhumacha aya, aneera wo ulhikaana ni mayareelho aya, ukhalhawaya arii owoothacha ni anaangoro o woothacha wonkhaye. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Nansho miyaano kinohimiacha ikeekhene, ukhalhaka phi nlhatu winyu wo uhikirumelhelha. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Mpani mmoka inyu nooria wooniha wiira kihowonya? Nansho yakhalhaka wiira kinoolhumacha aka iyo phi ikeekhene, woonaka khannokirumelhelha? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Ntu a Nlhuku nowiiwelhelha malhove a Nlhuku. Nansho, mwaattiva, khanhiwe a Nlhuku, phi ri aya chiichammo etu khanneewelhelha malhove awe.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahaawo Aburahimu ahinaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Ayahudi nkayannyoholhacha Yesu yiiraka, “Chani, khavanlhoka vaneera ihu wiira inyuva mwa Asamariya, nri ni nshoka no unanara?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Miyaano khakirina nshoka. Miyaano kinaathimicha Athumwanaka, nansho mwaattiva khannokithimicha. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Miyaano khakineechaviera nthimicho aka kimwanene. Nansho hawo naavia yoyo nthimicho uyo, ni uyo phi nohukumulha. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, ntu neewelhelha meettuchiho aka khanowa aakhwa nookhalha nkumi mahuku o uhimalha.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Ayahudi nkayaamwakhulha, “Paahi etu nihochuwelha vano wiira nrini nshoka! Aburahimu yahokhwa, anamilhohi ni ayo yahokwa, ni inyu nneera eti, Neewelhelha meettuchiho inyu khanokhwa, nookhalha nkumi mahuku o uhimalha. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Athumwanihu Aburahimu ahokhwa, chani woonaka inyuva nneepanga olhupalhe waapwaha Aburahimu? Anamilhohi ni ayo ahokhwacha. Ana inyuva nneechoona thoko apani?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Keethimichaka kimwanene, nthimicho aka kuhiwe ittu. Amoka anokithimicha mii phi Athumwanaka, aneera inyu mwaattiva wiira phi Nlhuku inyu. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Mwaattiva khannaachuwelha. Nansho kikenre wiira khakinaachuwelha, kaanothacha thoko mwaattivava. Nansho kihaachuwelha ni uvara nlhove naya. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Athumwaninyu Aburahimu yahottapelhelha wiira anowoona nihuku naka no uwa, ni ayo yahoona, nkayaateelhiya.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Ayahudi nkayankoha, “Inyuva khannaphiyelha iyaakha makhumi nthanu, ni inyu nneera wiira nhoona Aburahimu?” <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, Aburahimu ahinayaria, ‘Miyaano kihawo.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 8:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Vavawo nkayalhokottacha malhuku ammonyere, nansho Yesu nkaathama, nkaakhuma u Inupa ya Nlhuku.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu nonlhamiha ntu ohoona iyareelho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yesu vaari awe eetakachaka, ahomwoona ntu mmoka ohoona toka iyareelho. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Owiittucha awe nkayankoha, “Owiittuchiha, phi apani awonyilhe, ulha ntu ulha, ama manyanaangoro awe, hata ayariee hoonaka?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “U uhoona wu, khupangeelhe nlhatu no uwonya wawe, ama uwonya wa manyanaangoro awe. Aayarelhe hoonaka Nlhuku wiira awe ooniha ikuru awe chinopanga aya ntheko. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Uhinaya wiilha, nihothananiya uthepa uvara ntheko waya akirumme, uhiyu unoowa vahinooria awe ntu uvara ntheko. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Vari aka velhaponi, miyaano phi nthuko wo ilhapo.” <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Amalheke wulhumacha yayo malhove ayo, nkaashuwa ishenye vathi, nkoothuwa ipephe, nkanhika ntu ohoona ulhe mmiithoni, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />nkaamwirelha, “Urweeke wakhucheke u nttiya no Siloamu.” Maana o nenno nchina nno nikhalhaka “Rumiye”. Ntu ohoona ulhe nkaarwa, nkaakhucha, nkaahokolhia nari oonaka.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Amwaatamana awe ni attu yaamwoona alhepelhaka, nkayeera, “Chani, ulha kahena ntu aakhalha ni ulhepelha ulhe?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Attu akina yeera, “Phi yoyo.” Nansho attu akhwawe nkayeera, “Mena kahena! Howiiraka ulhikaana ni uyo.” Nansho ntu ahoona ulhe nkeera, “Phi miyaano!” <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Nkayankohacha, “Miitho inyu ayo yenre chani wo uttukulhiya?” <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Nkaakhulha, “Ntu neehaniya Yesu ulhe ahoothuwa ipephe, nkaakihika mmiithoni, ni ukiirelha, ‘Nrweeke mwakhucheke uri nttiya no Siloamu.’ Nkakaarwaa, vaari aka kikhuchaka, nkakaachokholha woona.” <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Nkayankoha, “Yoyo ntu uyo etu ri vayi?” Ni uyo nkaakhulha, “Akichuwenlhe mii.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amafarisayo anookohakoha mwaha wo ulhamihiya ntu ohoona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Yamalheke nkayanrweha ntu aari ohoona uyo wa Amafarisayo. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Nenno nihuku Yesu voothuwa awe ipephe ni unttukulha miitho ntu uyo nno, naari Nihuku no Wiittuwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Amafarisayo nkayankoha yoyo ntu uyo, enre chani wo woona. Ni uyo nkeera, “Ahookihika ipephe mmiithoni, Nkakaakhucha wiitho, ni mii vano kinowoona.” <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Amafarisayo akina nkayeera, “Ntu pannge chiicho khakhumme wa Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya khavarechenshe Malhehero o Nihuku no Wiittuwa.” Nansho akina nkayeera, “Ntu o uwonya nooria chani upanga cho ushangiha thoko chilha?” Nkawaakhulhanachiya iriyari aya. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Nkayankoha tho ntu aari ohoona ulhe, “Ukhalhawaya yoyo hoottukulhani miitho, nnomwoona thoko mpani?” Ni uyo nkaakhulha, “Kinomwoona yoyo, phi namilhohi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Inakhalhaka chiicho, Aholhelhi a Ayahudi khayarumelhenlhe wiira yoyo ntu uyo aari ohoona khalhayi vawo nansho vano nowoona, mpaka veehanne aya manyanaangoro awe, <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />nkayaakoha, “Chani ulha phi mwamwaninyu? Nneera inyu aayarelhe hoonaka, vano pantte vayi woona?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Manyanaangoro awe nkayaakhulha, “Eiyo ulha phi mwaamwanihu, aayarelhe hoonaka. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Nansho khanichuwenlhe wiira enre chani wo woona, mena khanichuwenlhe ntu nttukunlhee miitho awe. Munkoheke mwanene, honnuwa, nowooria wulhumacha mwanene!” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Manyanaangoro awe ayo yoolhumanche chiicho ukhalhawaya yaari yoovaka ahoolhelhi Ayahudi, aalhehenre wiira ntu riyoothe nottuna urumelhelha eeraka wiira Yesu phi Kuristo oomolhiye nnupani mwo unlhapelha Nlhuku. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Phi nlhatu etu no manyanaangoro awe ayo wiira, “Honnuwa, munkoheke mwanene.”<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Nkayaamwiihana nkwaha wo nayelhi ntu aari ohoona chiyareelho uyo, nkayaamwirelha, “Mummaheke Nlhuku nthimicho wiira nnohimia ikeekhene! Hiyaano nihochuwelha wiira ntu olhaminheni uyo rii o uwonya.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Uyo nkaakhulha, “Akhalhaka o uwonya miyaano khakichuwenlhe. Nansho ittu imoka kinochuwelha aka, kaari ohona, ni vano kinowoona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Nkayaathepa unkoha, “Opangenlheni chani? Ottukunlheni chani miitho inyu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Nkaakhulha, “Kihomalha uhimeriani, ni inyu khamwiiwelhenlhe. Nlhatu waani vano nnothanana wiiwa tho? Chani mwaattiva nnothanana ukhalha owiittucha awe?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Nansho ayo nkayannyoholhacha yiiraka, “Inyuva phi owiittucha awe, nansho hiyaano owiittucha a ashinna Musa. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Hiyaano nihochuwelha wiira Nlhuku aholhumana ashinna Musa, nansho ulha ntu ulha khanichuwenlhe khumme vayi!”<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Ni uyo nkaakhulha, “Vari vo ushangiha! Mwaattiva khanchuwenlhe khumme vayi, nansho mii hokittukulha miitho aka! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Nihochuwelha wiira Nlhuku khaneewelhelha attu o uwonya, ila neewelhelha attu anonthimicha ni upanga chinothanana awe. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Ukhuma vachokhonlhe aya ilhapo khiinewania wiira ntu honttukulha miitho ntu ayarelhe hoonaka. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Yakhalhaka yoyo ntu uyo khakhumme wa Nlhuku, khanooria upanga ittu iriyoothe.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Nkayaamwaakhulha, “Inyuva mwaayarelhe ni ulhelhiya mu uwonyani, nnooria chani uniittuchiha hiyaano?” Nkayaamomolha nnupani mwo lhapelha.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uhoona wo Munrimani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu veewilhe awe yoyo mwaha uyo, nkaamwona ntu oomolhiye nnupani mwo ulhapelha uyo nkankoha, “Chani, inyuva nnonrumelhelha Mwaana a Ntu?” <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Yoyo ntu uyo nkaakhulha, “Thithi, nkihimerie yoyo phi mpani, kinrumelhelhe!” <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu nkaamwirelha, “Nhomwoona, ni uyo phi noolhumacha ni inyu vano.” <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Paahi yoyo ntu uyo nkeera, “Thithi! Kinoorumelhelha.” Nkankhoromelha Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesu nkeera, “Miyaano kiwilhe velhaponi uwaahukumulhani attu, ahinoona oone, ni ayo aneechona wiira anowoona akhalhe ohoona.” <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Amafarisayo akina yaari vavawo ni uyo nkayeewa yayo malhove ayo, nkayankoha, “Chani, nneera wiira ni hii nirii ohoona chiicho?” <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Mwakaari ohoona, khamwakhalha ni milhatu cho utteka, nansho nneepanga wiira ‘Hiyaano ninowoona,’ ni iyo phi nooniha wiira bado nhowonya.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Nlhikaaniho no Nshunga o khondoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesu nkeera, “Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, ntu hinokelha wo uvira vanlhakoni ihilhi yo ikhondoro, apephenyaka ni uwelha wo iphiro ikina, yoyo ntu owiiya ni o uvara makhuche. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Nansho nokelha wo uvira vanlhakoni, yoyo phi nshunga o ikhondoro. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Nolhitelhelha ihilhi nonhulhelha nchelhe ni ikhondoro chinowiiwa nlhove nawe. Nowoopa nthuri wiihana ikhondoro chawe kila imoka wo nchina naya, ni uholhelha vathe. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Chamalhaka ukhuma vathe, noohoolhelha uhoolho, ni ikhondoro chinonttwara ukhalhawaya chihonchuwelha nshunga aya. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Ikhondoro khachinooria unttwara ntu hiri mwanene, chinonttawa ukhalhawaya khachichuwenlhe nlhove nawe.”<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu ahaahimeria nenno nlhikaaniho nno, nansho ayo khayachuwenlhe maana aya.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Nshunga Orera Nrima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Yesu nkeera tho, “Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, Miyaano phi nlhako wo ikhondoro. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Akina ayo, onkhaye aawilhe kihinaya mii, phi owiiya ni owaakha, ni ikhondoro khacheewelhenlhe. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Miyaano phi nlhako. Ntu nokelha wo uvirelha uwannyaka nowoopolhiya, nookelha ni ukhuma, ni upatta malhiho. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Attu owiiya anowa wo nrima wo wiiya, wiiva ni utanganya. Miyaano kiwilhe wiira mwaatti mpatte ukhalha ni ukumi, ukumi wo utimira.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />“Miyaano phi nshunga orera nrima, nokumiha ukumi awe wo nlhatu no wiinanelha ikhondoro chawe. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Namitheko o ulhiviya, hirii nshunga, ni ikhondoro chihikhalhaka chawawe, vanoona awe mwiichi uwaaka, noohiya ikhondoro ni uttawa, mwiichi nkawaavara ikhondoro ni umwarushacha. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Yoyo noottawa wo uhilhoha ittu, ukhalhawaya uyo rii namitheko o ulhiviya tu. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Miyaano phi nshunga orera nrima. Kinowaachuwelha arii awaka, ni ayo arii awaka anookichuwelha miyaano, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />thoko Athithi vanokichuwelha aya, ni mii chinaachuwelhaka Athithi. Miyaano kinookumiha ukumi aka wo nlhatu naya. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Chihawo tho ikhondoro chikina chawaka chihiri nhiilhini mu. Kihothananiya uwiiha ni chiyo, ni chiyo chinowiiwa nlhove naka, ni ukhalha mphingo mmoka ni nshunga mmoka.<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />“Athithi anokittuna ukhalhawaya kinookumiha ukumi aka wiira kiwe kaapochera tho. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Khaawo ntu o ukithurulha ukumi aka, miyaano kinokumiha wo uttuna waka kimwanene. Kihanaa ikuru yo ukumiha ni yo ukusha tho. Chiichammo phi malheheriyo kirumme aya Athithi kipange.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Uhiiwanana nkawaakhumelhelha tho munlhokoni mwa Ayahudi wo nlhatu no yayo malhove ayo. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Attu enchi yaari yiiraka, “Ri ni nshoka no unanara. Ri ni ihalhahalha! Ye ishiyani umwiiwelhelha?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Nansho attu akina nkayeera, “Ntu o nshoka no unanara khanooria wulhumacha malhove thoko alha! Nshoka ninooria chani uttukulha miitho a attu ohona?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nookhotiya ni Ayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Yayo mahuku ayo waari nlhaalha wo uririya, ni nihuku no wuupuwelha uttukuriya Inupa ya Nlhuku naari nittapelhelhiyaka Uyerusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yesu aari eetakachaka u Inupa ya Nlhuku vaari nipirothi ni Naselemani. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Ayahudi nkayanrukureria ni unkoha, “Nnohalha unihiya nichukulhaka mpaka yaakhani? Nkanihimerieni ikeekhene, chani inyuva phi Kuristo Moopolhi?”<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Kihoohimeriani, nansho khannorumelhelha. Mitheko chinopanga aka miyaano wo nchina na Athumwanaka phi nokihimiechesha, <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />nansho mwaattiva khannorumelhelha, ukhalhawaya mwaattiva kanhena ikhondoro chaka. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Ikhondoro chaka chinowiiwa nlhove naka, ni mii kihochuwelhacha, ni chiyo chinookittwara. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Miyaano kinowaavaha attu ukumi wo mahuku o uhimalha, ni ayo khanokhwa tho, mena khaawo ntu nooria ukithurulha. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Athumwanaka akivanhe yayo phi olhupalhe waapwaha onkhaye, khaawo etu nooria waathamiha mmathathani mwa Athithi. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Mii ni Athithi, amoka.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Ayahudi aholhokotta malhuku tho wiira amwaatane. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yesu nkeera, “Kihopanga ntheko mwinchi kivahiye aka na Athithi mwoonaka, phi ntheko waani etu wo chechiyo unoopangani nkaate ni malhuku?” <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Ayahudi nkayaamwaakhulha, “Khaninowaatani malhuku wo nlhatu no mitheko choombone, nansho wo nlhatu no unlhava Nlhuku! Ukhalhawaya nneepanga Nlhuku, uno nnari ntu thoko hii.” <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Chani, kilhepiye nhina Malhehero inyu wiira Nlhuku heera, ‘Miyaano kihohimia, mwaattiva milhuku?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Nihochuwelha wiira chinohimiya ni Malhove Matakatifu chiri che ikeekhene mahuku onkhaye, Nlhuku eehanaka yayo attu ayo milhuku, attu arwehelhiye nttenga awe.<verse eid="JHN 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />“Thoko chiri aka mii, Athithi ahokithanlha ni ukiruma velhaponi. Veeshiyani etu, nneera wiira kihonlhava Nlhuku wo wiipanga Mwaana a Nlhuku? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Nhikirumelhelheke etu, yakhalhaka wiira khakinopanga mitheko chilheheriyaka ni Athumwanaka. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Nansho yakhalhaka kinoopanga, ata mwaahikirumelhelheke, mena etu nrumelhelheke mitheko chiyo, wo uchuwelha wiira Athithi anookhalha nhina mwaka, ni mii kinookhalha nhina mwa Athithi.” <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Nkayaamwiithelha wiira ammare tho Yesu, nansho nkaakulhupuwa mmathathani mwaya.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Yesu nkaahokolhia tho ukhopelhelhe mwoolhoko wo Yorodani, vakittu Nayohana vaari aya aabatiizaka attu, nkaakhalha wowo. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Attu enchi nkayanrwelha nkayeera, “Nayohana khayaapannge yo ushangiha iriyoothe. Nansho yoolhumanche aya Nayohana amwaachaka ulha ntu ulha onkhaye aari e ikeekhene.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Ni attu enchi vavawo nkayanrumelhelha Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Nookhwa a Nalazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Ntu mmoka eehaniya Lazaro, nnenchi o Bethaniya, aari nreta. Ubethaniya waari ittoko yaakhalha aya Amariamu ni arokoraya Namatha. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Amariamu phi alhe yaahikilhe makhura o unukhelha Athithi mmietoni ni waapoholha ni ikharari chaya. Lazaro, mwanhima aya yayo phi ari nreta. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Paahi yayo manyarokorawe ayo nkayaarweha nttenga wa Yesu, “Thithi, ampwana inyu nnaattuna inyu areta.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Yesu eeweke chiicho, nkeera, “Yoyo ureta uyo khunommwiiha nookhwa, nansho wo nlhatu no unthimicha Nlhuku. Anowereiya ikhalhe phi iphiro yo uthimichiya Mwaana a Nlhuku.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yesu ahaattuna Namatha, Amariamu arokoraya ni Nalazaro. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Veewilhe awe nttenga wiira Nalazaro areta, nkaalhokelha vavawo vaari awe vawo wo mahuku melhi tho. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Yamalheke nkeerelha owiittucha awe, “Nirweeke nihokolhieke tho Uyudea!”<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Owiittucha nkayaamwaakhulha, “Owiittuchiha, mahuku vakani tu ahovira toka Ayahudi vaathanana aya uwaatani malhuku ni uwiivani, ni inyu nnothanana urwaa wowo tho?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Isaa cho uthana khachirii khumi ni pilhi? Paahi etu, ntu neeta uthana khanokwakwathuwa, ukhalhawaya nomwalheelhiya ni nthuko wo ilhapo. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Nansho ntu eetaka uhiyu nookwakwathuwa, ukhalhawaya khuuwo nthuko velhaponi.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Yesu nkoolhumacha yayo malhove ayo, ni umalhiha eeraka, “Ampwana ihu Nalazaro ahorupa, nansho Miyaano kinokelha waawusha.” <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Owiittucha awe nkayaamwiirelha, “Thithi, akhalhaka ahowiiraka urupa, paahi anolhama.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Owiittucha yaanyihera wiira ahowiiraka urupa nkhoveni, nansho Yesu aari ahimiaka wiira Nalazaro ahokhwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Yesu nkaahimeria wo uhavitha, “Nalazaro ahokhwa, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />nansho kinootelhiya wo nlhatu ninyu wiira khakaariwo wowo, wiira nrumelhelhe. Paahi etu nngwee nirweeke uwannyaya uwo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Natomaso (eehaniya Nivata) nkayeerelha owiittucha ashikhunanaya wiira, “Nirweeke etu ni hii vamoka ni Owiittuchiha ihu, yakhalhaka ukhwa naakhwaneke vamoka!”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nihihimusho ni ukumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yesu vaaphiilhe awe wowo, nkaaphwanya Nalazaro anamanlhe uvithiya nnihiyeni mahuku macheshe avinre. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Ittoko yo Ubethaniya khayaari utayi ni Uyerusalemu, nkwaha wo umalhaka imaili ttaaru, <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />ni Ayahudi enchi yaari anawiilhe u Namatha ni Amariamu uunyikalhachani nookhwa a nhima aya.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Namatha veewilhe aya wiira Yesu aari awaaka, nkayaarwa uumwikamelhani, nansho Amariamu ahalhaka nnupani. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Namatha nkayaamwiirelha Yesu, “Thithi, mwakaari vaa, nhima aka kaakhwa! <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Nansho kihochuwelha wiira hata vano iriyoothe inottuna inyu unlhepelha Nlhuku, nouvahani.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu nkeera, “Mwanhima inyu noohihimmwa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Namatha nkayaakhulha, “Kihochuwelha wiira anoohihimmwa nihuku no uhihimushiya attu, nihuku no umalhelha.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu nkeerelha, “Miyaano phi nihihimusho ni ukumi. Anokirumelhelha mii anokhalha akumi, anakhwaaka, <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />ni kila ntu ri nkumi nokirumelhelha, khanokhwa ngu nnokhalha nkumi mahuku o uhimalha. Chani, nnoorumelhelha yayo?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Namatha nkayaakhulha, “Eiyo Thithi! Miyaano kinoorumelhelha wiira inyuva phi Kuristo, Mwaana a Nlhuku, nowa velhaponi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noomoriha miithori</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Namatha yamalheke wulhumacha yayo, nkayaarwaa weehanani Amariamu, arokoraya, untemerani, nkayeera, “Owiittuchiha ahowa vaa, anowihanani.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Ni ayo yeeweke chiicho, nkayonkwa phiyaru, nkayaamwiikamelha Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Yesu aari hinaphiya vawani, nansho aari bado wowulhe Namatha waamwiikamenlhe aya. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Paahi etu Ayahudi yaakhanlhe mpaani yaavahaka nrima Amariamu, voonne aya yunkwaka ni ukhuma vathe wo uhipicha, nkayaattwara. Yaanyihera wiira anokelha unihiyeni uwunlhani.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Paahi Amariamu vaaphilhe aya vaari awe Yesu ni umwoona, ahokhoroma, nkayeera, “Thithi, thoko mwakaari vaa, nhima aka kaakhwa!” <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesu ooneke Amariamu yunlhaka, ni Ayahudi yaawilhe vamoka ni ayo yunlhaka, nkaakelhiya ikiriri ni ihuzuni munrimani. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Yamalheke nkaakoha, “Mwaavinthe vayi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Nkayaamwakhulha, “Thithi mmweeke mwoona.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu nkaamoriha miithori. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Paahi Ayahudi nkayeera, “Mwooneke chinre awe wo unttuna!”<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Nansho attu akina aya nkayeera, “Ahaattukulha miitho attu ohoona, ngati? Chani khoonrie waachiichiha Nalazaro ahikhwe?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nalazaro anohihimushiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Yesu aari onlhaka munrimani, nkaarwa unihiyeni, nihiye naari iphaa, ninakhuneelhiye nlhuku nulhupalhe vanlhakoni. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu nkeera, “Nithamihiye nlhuku nno!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Namatha, akhwelhiye ni mwanrokoraya Lazaro ayo, nkayeera, “Thithi, vanoonukha. Mahuku macheshe vano toka vavithiye aya!”<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu nkeerelha, “Chani, khakoohimenrieni wiira mwarumelhelhaka nnowoona nthimicho wa Nlhuku?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Nkayaathamiha nlhuku nne. Yesu nkaaweha nchulhu wiirimu, nkeera, “Kihopochera Thithi, ukhalhawaya inyuva nnookiwelhelha. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Kihochuwelha wiira nnookiiwelhelha mahuku onkhaye, nansho kinoolhumacha yayo wo nlhatu na alha attu arii vaa alha, wiira arumelhelhe, wiira inyuva phi kirumme.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Yesu amalhiheke wulhumacha yayo, nkeehana wo nlhove nulhupalhe eeraka, “Nalazaro! Nkhume vathe!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Nalazaro nkayaakhuma vathe, uno anattukiye isaanda mmietoni ni mmiononi, wiitho unakhuneelhiye. Yesu nkeera, “Mwaathaphulheke, mwaahiyeke arweeke.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Miruku cho umwiiva Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mak 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Paahi Ayahudi enchi yawaachilhe wa Amariamu yooneke cheechiyo chaapannge awe Yesu, nkayanrumelhelha. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Nansho akina aya nkayaarwaa wa Amafarisayo uwaahimeriani mwaha waapannge awe Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Wo chiichammo etu opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni Amafarisayo nkayaapanga ntemera wo Ibaraza yuulhupalhe, nkayeera, “Niireke chanii? Mwooneke chineera awe wo upanga cho ushangiha!<figure style="fig" file="18 Priest.jpg" size="col" ref="11:47">Opochera ishaani a Ayahudi</figure> <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Nanhiyaka, kila ntu nonrumelhelha, ni ahoolhelhi o Urumi anoowa uphomolha Inupa ya Nlhuku ni ukusha ilhapo ihu!”<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Amoka aya, yeehaniya Nakayafa, yaari opochera ishaani olhupalhe yeyo iyaakha iyo, nkeerelhacha, “Mwaattiva khannochuwelha ittu! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Chani, khannoona wiira nambaya ntu mmoka akhwe wo nlhatu ni attu, ilhapo yonkhaye ihirimeelhihiye?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Yayo khayoolhumanche chiicho wo uttuna waya anene, nansho ukhalhawaya yaari opochera ishaani olhupalhe yeyo iyaakha iyo, yaholhohera wiira Yesu nookhwa wo nlhatu no ilhapo aya, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />mena kuhena wo nlhatu na Ayahudi vekha, nansho wo waawiha vamoka ashaana a Nlhuku amwareelhe velhaponi.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Ukhuma nenno nihuku nno etu, ahoolhelhi Ayahudi yahopanga miruku cho uthanana umwiiva Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Wo chiichammo etu Yesu kheente tho voonene munlhokoni mwa Ayahudi, nansho nkaathama vavawo nkaarwa waatamenrie uthako, iwani ineehaniya Efuraimu. Nkaakhalha wowo vamoka ni owiittucha awe.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Nihuku na Ayahudi no Pasaka naari ninaatamenrie, ni attu enchi yahorwaa Uyerusalemu wiira ehapihe nihinaaya nihuku nno. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Attu nkayaahalha amwaaviaka Yesu, ni ayo vaathothokanne aya vamoka nnupani Inupa ya Nlhuku, nkayaakohanacha ashineneru, “Ninoona chani mwaatti? Inowooria wiira khanowa usikuukuni, ama noowa?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni Amafarisayo nkayaalhehera attu wiira ntu chuwenlhe vakittu vari awe Yesu arwee aahimiachere ni ayo yammare.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu noohikiya makhura Ubethaniya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mak 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Mahuku sita nihinaaya nihuku no Pasaka, Yesu ahorwaa Ubethaniya uwannyaya Nalazaro aahihimushiye ni Yesu ukhuma nnookhwani. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Wowo ahoterekelhiya yolhia yo uchechilho, yaaterekhiye ni Namatha, Nalazaro ni ayo ahokhalha vamezani vamoka ni Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Paahi etu Amariamu nkayaawia ntikha ilita yo makhura o unukhelha chinene o uhithakanihiya aathumihiya wo nchurukhu mwinchi, nkayanhika makhura Yesu mmietoni ni umpoholha wo ikharari chaya. Nihiriri nkanaachara mpaani mwonkhaye. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Yuda Isikariote, owiittucha mmoka aya khumi ni elhi, nohalha unthumiha Yesu, nkeera, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Wo nlhatu waani etu alha makhura alha uhithumihiya wo nchurukhu idinari imia ttaaru, ni uvahiya amashikini?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />olhumanche chiicho, kuhena wiira anaachukulhelha amashikini, nansho ukhalhawaya aari ntu owiiya. Eiyaka munrupani mwo ushungelha nchurukhu weetana awe.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Nansho Yesu nkeera, “Nhaahuvihe amanyi alha! Mwaahiyeke akeesheke tayari wo nihuku naka no uvithiya. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Amashikini nnowaakhalhana mahuku onkhaye, nansho khannokhalha ni mii wo mahuku onkhaye.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Miruku cho weeva Nalazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Attu enchi munlhokoni mwa Ayahudi nkayeewa wiira Yesu rii Ubethaniya, paahi etu, nkayaarwaa wowo, kuhiwe nansho wo nlhatu noomwona Yesu, nansho woona Nalazaro yaahihimushiye ni Yesu ukhuma nnookhwani. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Opochera ishaani olhupalhe nkayaapanga miruku cho weeva Nalazaro, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />ukhalhawaya wo nlhatu naya Ayahudi enchi yahohiya weewelhelha, nkayanrumelhelha Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noopocheriya Uyerusalemu wo nkhito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mak 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Waashelhe waya, milhoko chinchi cha attu chaawilhe usikuukuni chaheewa wiira Yesu aari mphironi uwa Uyerusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Paahi etu, nkayakushacha maritta o mitende, nkayaarwaa umwiikamelhani, akhuwelhaka eeraka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:13">“Atotopelhiye Nlhuku! Athimichiye uyo nowa wo nchina na Athithi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:13">Athimichiye Amwene o Uisraeli.”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesu nkaawiiheriya mwaaphuta mmoka, nkaawelha vachulhu vawe thoko chinohimiya aya ni Malhove Matakatifu,<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Nhoove iwani yo Sayuni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">Mummweheke, Mwene inyu noowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">nammwenlhe mwaaphuta!”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Owiittucha awe yaari ahichuwelhaka yoyo mwaha uyo, nansho Yesu amalheke uthimichiya, phi opuwenlhe aya wiira Malhove Matakatifu yaholhepiya, amwaachaka wiira attu yahompangelha yayo.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Attu yaari vamoka ni Yesu nihuku yeehanne awe Nalazaro ukhuma nnihiyeni, aahihimushaka ukhuma nnookhwani, yahonhimiechesha. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Nenno etu phi nlhatu no wiikamelhiya ni nlhoko mwinchi wa attu, ukhalhawaya yaheewa wiira Yesu ahopanga yeyo yo ushangiha iyo. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Paahi, Amafarisayo nkayeerelhana, “Nnowoona vano? Khaninooria upanga ittu iriyoothe! Mmweheke, ilhapo yonkhaye inonttwara!”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayunani akina anothanana umwoona Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Ahokhalha Ayunani mumphingoni mwa attu yaarwelhe Uyerusalemu uuthimichani nihuku no Pasaka nno. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Nkayarwaa u Nafilipo, anenchi o Ubethsaida yo Galilaya, ni wiira, “Pwiiya, ninothanana umwoona Yesu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Nafilipo nkayaarwaa, nkayeerelha Naandorea, ni ayo oyelhi nkayaarwaa unhimeriani Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu nkeera, “Isaa yo uthimichiya Mwaana a Ntu ihophiya! <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, imbeyu yo marupi inohalha imbeyuru yaahimoreke vattayani ni ukhwa. Yakhwaaka, phi noyara aya marupi menchi. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Attu anottuna ukumi aya anoopoteriha, anovenga makhalhelho o ukumi wo velhaponi va, anoshungerera wo nlhatu wo ukumi wo mahuku o uhimalha. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Ntu nothanana ukikaviha ntheko, hothananiya ukittwara, ikhalhe wiira variyoothe variaka miyaano ni akarumiya aka anottuna ukhalha vavawo. Ntu nokikaviha, Athumwanaka anonvaha nthimicho.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noomulhumachera nookhwa awe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Vano nnepa aka unoohuperia, ni mii kuulhumachekeni etu? Chani kiire, ‘Thithi, nkoopolhe ilha ikatema ilha ihikiphiyelhe?’ Nansho phi nlhatu wo uwa waka, wiira kivire ilha ikatema yo uweria ilha. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Thithi, nthimicheke vano nchina ninyu.” Vavawo nlhove nkaneewaniaa ukhuma wiirimu, “Kihothimicha, ni vavawo kinoothimicha tho.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Attu yaari aneemenlhe vavawo yaheewa nenno nlhove nno, ni attu akina aya nkaanyihera ithari nansho akina aya nkayolhumacha, “Nnepa wo wiirimu uholhumacha umuulhumana!” <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Nansho Yesu nkeerelha, “Nenno nlhove nno khaniiwanelhe wo nlhatu aka miyaano, ila wo nlhatu ninyu. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Vanova phi ikatema yo uhukumulhiya ilhapo, vanova Nakare nholhelhi o ilhapo ilha noopikhulhiya. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Ni mii kennulhiyaka vachulhu ilhapo kinommwiiha kila ntu uwannyaka.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Wo wulhumacha chiicho ahooniha naakhweke nookhwa ani.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Paahi yoyo nlhoko uyo nkawaamwaakhulha, “Hiyaano ninoohimeriya ni Malhehero ihu wiira Kuristo khaawa aakhwa nookhalha nkumi mahuku o uhimalha. Nnooria chani etu wiira, Mwaana a Ntu nowiinulhiya? Yoyo Mwaana a Ntu uyo phi mpani?” <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Nthuko bado urii ni inyu wo mahuku vakani. Mweeteke nnari ni yoyo nthuko uyo ipiphi ihuupatteni, ukhalhawaya aneeta mpiiphini khanochuwelha unokelha aya. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Paahi etu, ikatema nnari ni yoyo nthuko uyo nrumelhelheke nkhalhe attu o nthuko.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Amalheke wulhumacha yayo malhove ayo, Yesu nkaarwa vaari utayi ni ayo.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uhikhalha ni nrima wa attu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Anakhalhaka Yesu ahopangacha cho ushangiha chonkhaye chiyo yoonaka, khayaanrumelhenlhe. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Chiichammo etu malhove yoolhumanche aya anamilhohi ashinna Isaya nkayatimira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">“Thithi, apani arumelhenlhe nttenga ihu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">Ni ikuru ya Athithi ichuwaneelhe wa apani?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Chiicho khayoonrie urumelhelha, ukhalhawaya ashinna Isaya yahoolhumacha tho wiira,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Nlhuku hotiyelhelha miitho aya ahoone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">hophupuwalhiha mirima chaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">ahoone wo miitho aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">ahichuwelhe wo irusho chaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">mena ahikirukunuwelhe, aneera Athithi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">wiira kaalhamihe.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Ashinna Isaya yoolhumanche yayo malhove ayo ukhalhawaya yahoona nthimicho wa Yesu, nkayaahimiacha mwaha wawe.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Hata chiicho, ahoolhelhi enchi Ayahudi yahonrumelhelha Yesu. Nansho wo nlhatu ni Amafarisayo, khayolhumanche mwaha wo unrumelhenlha Yesu voonene, yaari yoovaka wiira anowoomolhiya nnupani mwo unlhapelha Nlhuku. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Yaathanana uthimichiya ni attu kuhiwe utotopelhiya ni Nlhuku.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nlhove na Yesu ninowaahukumulha attu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Yamalhekeru Yesu nkaawelhiha nlhove nkaahimia wiira, “Ntu nokirumelhelha, khanokirumelhelha mii tu, ila nowaarumelhelha ni ayo akirumme. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Attu anokoona miyaano anoowona akirumme. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Miyaano kiwiilhe velhaponi kikhalhe nthuko, attu onkhaye anokirumelhelha ahihalhe mwiipiphini. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Ntu neewa malhove aka nansho wo uhivarelhelha, miyaano khakinonhukumulha, ukhalhawaya khakiwilhe uhukumulhani ilhapo nansho woopolhani attu o velhaponi. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Attu ahinovarelhelha malhove aka ahana ntu mmoka owahukumulha. Nlhove nuulhumachilhe aka phinottuna waahukumulha nihuku no umalhelha! <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Miyaano khakuulhumanche wo ikuru aka kimwanene, Athithi akilhehenre malheheriyo ayo phi kivanhe yo wulhumacha. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Ni mii kinoochuwelha wiira malhehero aya anoowiha ukumi wo uhimalha. Paahi etu, miyaano kinohimiacha Athithi akilheehenre aya.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowaakhuchiha owiittucha awe mieto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Nihuku nimoka Pasaka hinaphiya, Yesu ahochuwelha wiira isaa awe yo uthama velhaponi ni urwaa wa Athithi ihophiya. Ahaattuna chinene attu awe arii velhaponi, waattuna uhimmalha!<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Paahi Yesu ni owiittucha awe yaari anakhanlhe ulhia yolhia yo uchechilho. Nakare ahomalha unkelha Yuda mwaana a Nasimoni Isikariote, ni ummaha nrima wo unthumiha Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu ahochuwelha wiira Athithi yahonvaha chittu chonkhaye mmathathani mwawe. Ni wiira aakhumme wa Nlhuku, ni vano nohokolhia wa Nlhuku. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Paahi ahothama vamezani nkeesha vathotho mwiinjiro awe, nkaakusha nchako nkeettuka nnyununi. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Yamalheke nkaahelha maashi munkhatoni, nkaachokholha waakhuchiha owiittucha awe mieto ni upoholha wo nchako weettunke awe. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Paahi nkaaphiyelha Nasimoni Peturo, nansho Napeturo nkayeera, “Thithi, inyuva nkikhuchihe mii mieto chaka?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Khannochuwelha vano ittu kinopanga aka nansho nnochuwelha kaanyuma.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Napeturo nkayamwiirelha Yesu, “Inyuva khannokikhuchiha mieto mahuku onkhaye, ngu!” Yesu nkaakhulha,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">“Kaahukuchihekeni mieto chinyu khannokhalha owiittucha aka.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Nasimoni Peturo nkayaakhulha, “Thithi, nkikuchiheke, kuhiwena mietoru, nansho ni miono chaka ni muru ni uyo.”<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu nkeerelha, “Ntu rampe khanothananiya ukhucha yaahikhalheke mieto, ukhalhawaya homalha iruttu awe yonkhaye ihorera. Mwaattiva nhohapihiya, nansho kanhiwe onkhaye.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesu ahonchuwelha ntu nottuna unthumiha, phi nlhatu no wiira, “Mwaattiva nhohapihiya, nansho kanhiwe onkhaye nri orera.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Amalheke waakhuchiha mieto ni uwara tho mwiinjiro awe, ahokhalha vamezani, nkeerelha, “Chani, nhochuwelha yayo kuupangenlheakani ayo? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Mwaattiva nnokiihana Owiittuchiha ni Athithi, vavawo nhoolhumacha rata, ukhalhawaya phi mii. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Paahi yakhalhaka miyaano kirii Athithi ni Owiittuchiha inyu kihookhuchihani mwaattiva mieto, ni mwaattiva chiicho nkhuchihaneke mieto mwaashineneru. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Kihoovahani malhikaaniho, ni inyu mpangelhaneke chiicho thoko chupangenlheakani. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Kinouhimeriani wo ikekhiaye wiira, ipotta kirina ikuru yo umpwaha mwanene ntheko awe, mena akarumiya khanokhalha ni ikuru yulhupalhe waapwaha naaruma. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Paahi etu, yakhalhaka nnoochuwelha yayo, mwapangaka nnoopuha.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Alha kinolhumachaka alha khaanowaachani mwaattiva onkhaye. Miyaano kinowaachuwelha alhe kaathanlhalhe aka. Nansho ihophwanelhiya utimire wo Malhove Matakatifu aneera, ‘Ulhe lhilhie yolhia aka hokirukunuwelha kimwanene.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Miyaano kinouhimeriani ihinaya ukhumelhelha, vanottuna aya ukhumelhelha vawo mmwe mwaarumelhelha wiira ‘Miyaano Phi Yoyo.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Ikekhiaye kinouhimeriani, nompochera ntu kinonruma aka nokipochera mii, ni ntu nokipochera mii, naapochera akirumilhe.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noolhohera wiira noothumihiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mat 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mak 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Yesu amalheke wulhumacha, ahokelhiya ihuzuni chinene munrimani, nkeera wo uhivitha, “We ikekhiaye kinohimiechesha wiira mmoka inyu nookithumiha!” <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Owiittucha nkayawehana ashineneru, ashangaka chinene wo uhichuwelha wiira nohimiani. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Owiittucha mmoka, aattuniya ni Yesu chinene, ahokhalha wo umwaatameria Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Nasimoni Peturo nkayanthoonyera ni umwiirelha, “Mwaakoheke anaacha apani?” <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Owiittucha uyo nkaachushera ni umwaatameria chinene Yesu, nkankoha, “Thithi, phi apani?” <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ntu kinohalha aka ummaha nkatte kipamphe aka nnyiponi, phi yoyo.” Paahi, nkaakusha ikipande yo nkatte, nkaapapha nnyiponi, nkammaha Yuda mwaamwana a Nasimoni Isikariote. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Yuda Isikariote amalheke upochera yeyo ikipande iyo, Nakare nkaakelha. Paahi Yesu nkaamwirelha, “Inothanana inyu upanga iyo pangakani wo uhipicha!” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Nansho khaawo anakhalhaka ntu mmoka aya aakhanlhe va yolhiani aachuwenlhe wo nlhatu waani eerelhiya chiicho. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Ukhalhawaya Yuda aari ntu o ushunga nrupa wo nchurukhu, owiittucha akina nkayaanyihera wiira Yesu aari anrumaka arwee athume chaathananiya wo nihuku no Pasaka, ama wiira arwee aavahe amashikini. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Paahi Yuda amalheke ukusha ikipande yo nkatte ilhe, nkaakhuma vathe wo uhipicha. Yeyo yaari uhiyu.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malhehero o naanano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Yuda athameke, Yesu nkeera, “Vano Mwaana a Ntu hothimichiya, ni uyo Nlhuku hothimichiya nhina mwawe. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Thoko nthimicho wa Nlhuku chipatakulhiye aya nhina Mwaana a Ntu, ni uyo Nlhuku nowooniha nthimicho wo Mwaana a Ntu nhina mwawe mwanene, ni upanga chiicho wo uhipicha.<verse eid="JHN 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />“Achishaana aka, khakinaya kirii ni inyu wo ikatema vakani tu. Nnookaavia, nansho vano kinouhimeriani alhe yaahimenrie aka ahoolhelhi Ayahudi, ‘Unokelha aka mii, mwaattiva khannooria urwaa!’ <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Kinouvahani malhehero o naanano, nttunaneke mwaashineneru, nttunaneke thoko chuuttunne akani mwaattiva. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Mwattunanaka mwaashineneru, attu onkhaye anoochuwelha wiira mwaattiva phi owiittucha aka.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noolhohera wiira Napeturo anonkhota</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mak 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Nasimoni Peturo nkayaakoha, “Thithi nnokelha vayi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Yesu nkaakhulha, “Unokelha aka khannooria ukittwara vano, nansho nnookittwara kaanyuma.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Napeturo nkayaamwirelha, “Thithi, nlhatu waani kihoorie uuttwarani vanova? Kirii tayari ukumiha ukumi aka wo nlhatu winyu!”<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Chani nrii tayari ukumiha ukumi inyu wo nlhatu waka? Ikekhiaye kinouhimeriani wiira, nthupi uhinaya wiipa nnowa mwaakikhota vararu mwiiraka khankichuwenlhe mii.”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu phi iphiro yo ukelha wa Athithi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesu nkeerelha, “Nhichukulhe munrimani mwinyu. Munrumelhelheke Nlhuku, nkirumelhelheke ni mii. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Vano mii kinokelha ukoroshelhani nipuro. Ukhalhawaya uwani wa Athumwanaka mapuro ari menchi, ihikaari chiicho, kanouhimeriani. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Karwaaka ni uukoroshelhani nipuro, kinoohokolhia uwa ukushani uwannyaka, ni inyu nkhalhe vari aka miyaano. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Ni inyu nhochuwelha iphiro yo urwaa wowo unokelha aka uwo.” <verse eid="JHN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Natomaso nkayankoha, “Thithi, khaninchuwelha unokelha inyu, ninohalha uchuwelha chani etu, yeyo iphiro iyo?” <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Miyaano phi iphiro, ikeekhene ni ukumi. Khaawo ntu nooria urwaa wa Athithi aahivireke uwannyaka. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Yakhalhaka nhokichuwelha miyaano, nnowaachuwelha ni Athumwanaka chiicho. Ni toka vano, nnowaachuwelha, tho nhomalha woona.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Nafilipo nkayaamwiirelha, “Thithi, nnooniheke Athithi, ni hii inonithosha.” <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu nkeerelha, “Kihokhalha ni inyu mahuku onkhaye alha, ni inyu Nafilipo bado khannakichuwelha? Akoonne mii ahoona Athithi. Nnooria chani etu wiira, ‘Nnoonihe Athithi?’ <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Chani Nafilipo khannorumelhelha wiira miyaano kinokhalha nhina Athithi, ni ayo Athithi anokhalha nhina mwaka? Akinoolhumacha malhove wo ikuru aka, Athithi arii nhina mwaka phi nopanga mitheko chaya. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Nhothananiya ukirumelhelha vaneera aka wiira miyaano kinokhalha nhina Athithi ni ayo Athithi anokhalha nhina mwaka. Ama etu, nrumelhelheke wo nlhatu no mitheko chinopanga aka. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Ikekhiaye kinouhimeriani, anokirumelhelha mii anoopanga mitheko chinopanga aka miyaano, eiyo, anoopanga ata moolhupalhe chinene, ukhalhawaya kinokelha wa Athithi. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Ittu iriyoothe inottuna inyu ulhepelha wo nchina naka kinoopanga, wiira nthimicho wa Athithi wooniye nhina mwawe Mwaana a Ntu. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Mwakilhepelhaka ittu iriyoothe wo nchina naka, kinouvahani.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheera noonivaha Iphumu ya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />“Mwakittunaka, nnoovara malhehero aka. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Kinowaalhepelha Athithi wiira ammwiihe Okaviha nkina, nohalha ukhalha ni inyu mwaattiva wo mahuku o uhimalha. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Yoyo phi Iphumu ya Nlhuku nohalha upatakulha ikeekhene ya Nlhuku. Attu o velhaponi khanowa ampochera ukhalhawaya khanowa aamwoona, mena unchuwelha. Nansho mwaattiva nnowa mwanchuwelha ukhalhawaya noowa aakhalha nhina mwinyu.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />“Khakinoohiyani mwaattiva thoko ashaana ohiiya, kinoohokolhia tho uwaninyu. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Ihohalha vakani attu o velhaponi khanowa yaakona tho. Nansho mwaattiva nnookona, ukhalhawaya miyaano kinkumi, ni inyuva chiicho nnookhalha akumi. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Nenno nihuku nno vanohalha aya waaya nnoowa mwaachuwelha wiira miyaano kiri nhina mwa Athithi, ni inyuva nrii nhina mwaka, thoko ni mii kiriaka nhina mwinyu.<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />“Ntu nopochera malhehero aka ni uvara, yoyo phi nokittuna. Ntu nokittuna miyaano noottuniya ni Athumwanaka, ni mii kinowaattuna ni wiichoniha uwannyaya.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Nayuda, kahiwe Isikariote ulhe, nkayaamwiirelha, “Thithi, vanoorieke chani inyuva wiichooniha uwanihu hii, kuhiwe wa attu o velhaponi?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Ntu akittunaka, noovarelhelha malhove aka. Athumwanaka anonttuna, ni hii ninoowa neesha nipuro uwannyawe. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Ntu hinokittuna khanovarelhelha malhove aka. Nlhove niiwilhe inyu nno kanihiwe nawaka, nansho na Athithi akirumme.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />“Kihoohimeriani ulha mwaha ulha vano, kinari vamoka ni inyu. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Okaviha, Iphumu ya Nlhuku, nottuna urumiya ni Athithi wo nchina naka uyo, noowittuchihani kila ittu ni uwupushani chittu chonkhaye chuuhimenrieakani.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />“Mpuha phi nouhiyeraakani, kinouvahani mpuha aka. Akinoovahani thoko attu o velhaponi chineera aya. Nhikhelhiye nipampa munrimani, mena nhoove. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Nheewa kuuhimeriakani, ‘Kinoorwaa, nansho kinoohokolhia tho uwaninyu.’ Yakaari mwahokittuna, mwanteelhiya woona wiira kinokelha wa Athithi, ukhalhawaya yayo phi olhupalhe ukipwaha mii. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Kihoohimeriani malhove menchi ihinaya ukhumelhelha, vanohalha aya ukhumelhelha vawo mmwe mwaarumelhelha. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Khakinoolhumacha ni inyu tho mwaha mulhupalhe, ukhalhawaya nholhelhi o velhaponi, Nakare ri muuwani. Nansho uwannyaka miyaano kharina machiri, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />nansho attu o velhaponi anoothananiya uchuwelha wiira kinowaattuna Athithi, phi nlhatu noopanga kila ittu thoko Athithi chikilheherilhe aya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">“Mweemelheke, nirweeke, nngwe nithame vaa.<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu phi Nzabibu we Ikekheene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Miyaano phi nzabibu we ikeekhene, ni Athumwanaka phi namalhima. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Kila nritta nhina mwaka nihinemma maphepu nenno ninoothamihiya, kila nritta ninemma rata ninookhwacheriya nithepeke wimma. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Mwaattiva nhokhalha orera wo nlhatu no meettuchiho kuwiittuchinheakani. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Nkhalheke nnalhutaanne ni mii, ni mii kikhalhe nhina mwinyu. Nritta khaninooria wimma vekha aya, naahilhutaaneke ni ntepo naya. Phi chiichammo etu ni inyu mwaattiva khannooria wimma izabibu mwaahilhutaaneke ni mii nhina mwaka.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />“Miyaano phi ntepo no zabibu, ni inyu mwaatti phi maritta. Nolhutaana ni mii, ni mii kalhutaanaka nhina mwawe, yoyo nowimma maphepu menchi, ukhalhawaya ntu hinokhalha ni mii khanooria upanga ittu iriyoothe. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Ntu riyoothe ahilhutaaneke ni mii noorihelhiya vathe thoko nritta ninorihiya aya vachereshere nkanooma. Maritta thoko yayo anookhupiya ni urihelhiya vamooroni avie. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Mwakhalhaka nhina mwaka ni malhove aka akhalhaka nhina mwinyu, paahi etu, nlhepelheke ittu iriyoothe nnothanana inyu, nnoovahiya. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Nthimicho wa Athithi unowoonia mwemmaka maphepu menchi, vavawo etu phi noohalha inyu ukhalha owiittucha aka. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Kinottunani mwaattiva thoko Athithi chikittunne aya mii, nhalheke nchuwelhaka wiira kinouttunani. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Mwavaraka malhehero aka nnookhalha mu uttunani mwaka, thoko ni mii chivanre aka malhehero a Athumwanaka ni ukhalha mu uttunani mwaya.<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />“Kihoohimeriani ulha mwaha ulha ikhalhe wiira uteelhiya waka ukhalhe nhina mwinyu, ni uteelhiya winyu utimire. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Malhehero aka phi alha, nttunaneke mwaashineneru, nttunaneke thoko chuuttunne akani mwaattiva. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Khuuwo uttuna wulhupalhe chinene umpwaha uttuna wo ntu nokumiha ukumi awe wo nlhatu no manyampwana awe. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Mwaattiva nnookhalha manyampwana aka mwapangaka kinoolheherakani alha. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Khakinowiihanani tho mwaatti akarumiya, ukhalhawaya karumiya khanochuwelha chinopanga aya anene ntheko anonruma. Nansho miyaano kinowiihanani mwaattiva manyampwana, ukhalhawaya kihouhimeriani chonkhaye chiiwilhe aka wa Athumwanaka. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Kanhiwe mwaatti mwaakithanlhe miyaano, mii phi othanlheni, nkakoorumani nrwee mwemme maphepu menchi, maphepu anolhokelha. Athithi awe yoovahani ittu iriyoothe inaalhepelha inyu wo nchina naka. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Paahi etu, malhehero aka uwaninyu phi alha, nttunaneke mwaashineneru.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ichimwa ya attu o velhaponi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Ichimwa ya attu o velhaponi yoophwanyakani mwaattiva, muupuwelheke wiira yahokiphwanya miyaano ihinaaya uuphwanyani mwaatti. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Yakaari wiira nri attu o velhaponi, ilhapo yaanottunani mwaattiva thoko attu aya. Mwaattiva kanhiwe attu o velhaponi, nansho miyaano kihouthanlhani velhaponi va, wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu ilhapo inoupangelhani ichimwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Muupuwelhacheke yohimenrieakani wiira, ‘Ipotta khachirina ikuru umpwaha mwanene ntheko naaruma.’ Yakhalhaka ahokihuviha miyaano, anouhuvihani ni mwaattiva chiicho, yakhalhaka ahovara nlhove naka, anoovara ni nlhove ninyu chiicho. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Chechiyo chonkhaye chiyo anowa opangelhani mwaattiva wo nlhatu wo urumelhelha nchina naka, ukhalhawaya khayaachuwenlhe akirumme. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Yakaari khakaawilhe ni wulhumacha, yayo khayaakhalha ni milhatu, nansho vano kharina nlhove no wiivaraanga wiira khanawonya.<verse eid="JHN 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />“Ntu nokipangelha ichimwa miyaano, nowaapangelha ichimwa ni Athumwanaka chiicho. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Kihikaapannge uwannyaya mwaha uhinapacha upangiya ni ntu nkina khayaakhalha ni nlhatu wiira ahowonya. Nansho vano ahoona chipannge aka nkayaakipangelha ichimwa miyaano, nkayaapangelha ichimwa Athumwanaka chiicho. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Paahi etu, malhove arii nhina Malhehero aya, ahophiyelha, ‘Ahokipangelha ichimwa wo uhikhalha nlhatu!’<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Vanohalha awe uwa Okaviha kinohalha aka unruma uwaninyu uyo, Iphumu ya Nlhuku, nowa aapatakulha ikeekhene ya Nlhuku, yoyo noowa aahimiechesha ikeekhene inokaacha mii. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Ni inyu mwaattiva chiicho, nnoowa mwaakihimiechesha ukhalhawaya nri vamoka ni mii ukhuma vaachokhonlhe aya.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />Yesu nkeerelha tho “Kihouhimeriani yayo wiira nhihiye nrima nrina inyu. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Attu anowoomolhani mwaattiva mmanupani mwaya mwo unlhapelha Nlhuku. Eiyo tho, mahuku anoowa, kila ntu nothanana uwiivani mwaattiva naanyihereke wiira nonkaviha Nlhuku. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Attu anowa uupangelhani yoyo mwaha uyo ukhalhawaya khaachuwenlhe Athithi, mena khakichuwenlhe mii. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Paahi etu, kihoohimeriani yayo ikatema yo upangia waya yaphiyaka, mmwe mwoopuwelha wiira kahowaamukani.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 16:4">Ntheko wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Khakoohimenrieni ulha mwaha ulha toka khalhayi ukhalhawaya kaari vamoka ni inyu. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Nansho vano kinokelha wa ayo akirumme ayo, nansho khaawo inakhalhaka mmoka inyu nokikoha wiira nnokelha vayi. <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Ukhalhawaya vano kihouhimeriani yoyo mwaha uyo, ihuzuni ihoucharani mu nrimani mwinyu. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Kinouhimeriani ikeekhene wiira, ihorera nambaya miyaano kirwee, ukhalhawaya kaahirweeke, Okaviha uyo khanowa uwaninyu. Paahi etu, karwaakaru, kinonruma uwaninyu. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Ni uyo vanottuna awe uwa, nowoopusha attu o velhaponi wiira irusho chaya chihowonya, ahottekelha ikekhia ni ihukumu ya Nlhuku. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Ahowonya wo nlhatu wo hikirumelhelha. <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Ahohiya mwaha wo uvara ikekhia, ni ukhalhawaya vano kinokelha wa Athithi, khannokoona tho. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Ahotteka mwaha wo ihukumu ya Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya nholhelhi o velhaponi va, Nakare homalha uhukumulhiya.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Kihanaa malhove menchi o uhimeriani, nansho vano, khannooria uvilhelha. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Vanohalha awe uwa Iphumu ya upatakulha ikeekhene ya Nlhuku, nouchuwelhihani ikeekhene yonkhaye. Khanowa ahimiachaka wo ikuru awe mwanene, nansho noolhumacheke inohalha awe wiiwa ni uchuwelhihani chittu chinowa. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Yoyo naakithimicheke mii, ukhalhawaya nowa uuchuwelhihani chinohalha awe wiiwa uwannyaka. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Chittu chonkhaye chirina aya Athithi phi chawaka, phi nlhatu no uhimia wiira Iphumu ya Nlhuku nouchuwelhihani chinohalha aka ummaha ovaheni.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihuzuni ni Mpuha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Ihohalha ikatema vakani mwaatti khannokona, ni ikatema vakani inowa nnookona.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Owiittucha awe akina nkayakohana ashineneru, “Ana nohimiani vanoniirelha awe, ‘Wo ikatema vakani khannokoona, ni ikatema vakani inowa nnookona?’ Tho neera, ‘Ukhalhawaya kinokelha wa Athithi!’ <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Rina maana ani vaneera awe, ‘Wo ikatema vakani?’ Khanichuwenlhe inoolhumacha awe.”<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu ahochuwelha wiira yaathanana unkoha, paahi etu nkeerelha, “Chani, woonaka nnookohana mwaashineneru mwaha kuulhumanche aka wiira, ‘Wo ikatema vakani khannokoona, ni ikatema vakani inowa nnookona tho?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Kinouhimeriani ikekhiaye, mwaattiva nnowunlha ni uwereiya munrimani, nansho ilhapo inootelhiya, nnookhalha ni ihuzuni nansho ihuzuni inyu inoorukunuwa ukhalha uteelhiya nrima. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Ikatema opani ari munkurini vaneethaphulha aya anowoona uweria aya ukhalhawaya ikatema yo uweria ihophiya, nansho amalhaka wiithaphulha khaanoopuwelha tho uweria uwo nlhatu no uteelhiya wiira mwaana mwankani hoyaria velhaponi. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Chiichammo phi ri aya uwaninyu mwaatti, vano nri mu wuunlhani, nansho kinowa koowoonani tho, ni mirima chinyu chinowa uteelhiya, uteelhiya uhinooria uthamihiya ni ntu.<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />“Nenno nihuku nno nawaaka, khannowa mwaakilhepelha ittu iriyoothe. Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, iriyoothe inottuna inyu waalhepelha Athithi wo nchina naka, anouvahani. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Mpaka nna khannavekelha ittu iriyoothe wo nchina naka. Nvekelheke nnoovahiya, ikhalhe wiira uteelhiya winyu utimire.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu hooria ilhapo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Kihoohimeriani yayo wo malhikaaniho. Nansho ikatema inoowa vahinowa aka wulhumacha wo malhikaaniho, nansho kinowa wulhumacha mwaari wo uhivitha mwaha unaacha Athithi. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Nenno nihuku nno nawaaka, nnowa mwaalhapelha Athithi wo nchina naka, kuuhimeriakani wiira akinowa kaalhepelha wo ulhepelhelhani mwaattiva, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />ukhalhawaya Athithi anene anouttunani mwaattiva. Anouttunani ukhalhawaya mwaattiva nhokittuna mii ni urumelhelha wiira kikhumme wa Nlhuku. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Miyaano kaakhumme wa Athithi, nkakaawa velhaponi, uno vano kinoohiya ilhapo ni uhokolhia wa Athithi.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Paahi owiittucha awe nkayaamwiirelha, “Eiyo, vano nnoolhumacha wo uhivitha, nhuulhumachaka wo malhikaaniho. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Vano nihochuwelha wiira inyuva nnoochuwelha kila ittu, ihooriaka uukohani tho ittu iriyoothe. Yeyo phi nonirumelhelhilha wiira nkhumme wa Nlhuku.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu nkaakhulhacha, “Chani, nnoorumelhelha vano? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Ikatema inoowa, ni iyo ihomalha uphiya, mwaattiva onkhaye vanottuna inyu umwariaa kila ntu uwannyawe, ni mii kinoohiiya yeekha aka. Nansho miyaano khakirii yekhaaka, ukhalhawaya Athithi arii vamoka ni mii. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Kihoohimeriani ulha mwaha ulha wiira nkhalheke ni mpuha wo ulhutaana ni mii. Nnoowa mwaahuvihiya velhaponi, nansho mpisheke nrima! Miyaano kihokottolha ilhapo!”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowaalhepelhelha owiittucha awe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesu amalheke wulhumacha yayo, nkaaweha nchulhu wiirimu, nkeera, “Thithi, ikatema ihophiya! Munthimicheke Mwamwaninyu ni uyo Mwaana othimichekeni. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Ukhalhawaya mwahonvaha Mwamwaninyu ikuru wa attu onkhaye, wiira aavahe ukumi wo uhimalha attu onkhaye munvanhe inyu ayo. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Ni ukumi wo uhimalha unari wiira uuchuwelhani inyuva, nrii yeekha inyu Nlhuku e ikeekhene, ni unchuwelha Yesu Kuristo, munrumme inyu. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Miyaano kihoothimichani velhaponi vaa, kihomalhiha ntheko ukivanhe inyu kipange. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Thithi! Nkivaheke nthimicho vano, nthimicho kaarina aka ilhapo ihinaaya wuupiya.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Kihaachuwelhiha attu nchina ninyu, yayo nkivanhe inyu ukhuma velhaponi. Yaari attu awinyu, ni inyuva nkamwaakivaha. Ni ayo ahovara nlhove ninyu. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Ahochuwelha vano wiira kila ittu ikivanhe inyu ikhumme uwaninyu. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Miyaano kihaavaha nttenga ukivanhe inyu, ni ayo ahopochera, ahochuwelha wiira wo ikekhiaye kikhumme uwaninyu, ni ayo anoorumelhelha wiira inyuva nhokiruma.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />“Kinaalhapelhelha yayo, mena khakinaalhepelhelha attu o velhaponi, nansho kinaalhepelhelha attu akivanhe inyu, ukhalhawaya phiri awinyu. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Attu onkhaye arina aka phi awinyu, ni awinyu phi awaka, ni nthimicho waka uhoonia wa attu akivanhe inyu. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Vano kinoowa uwaninyu, kakihiwe tho ntu o velhaponi, nansho ayo arii velhaponi. Athithi atakatifu! Wo machiri o nchina ninyu nikivanhe inyu, chonte mwaashunge rata akhalhe ittu imoka thoko hiyaano chiri ihu amoka. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Vaari aka ni ayo, miyaano kahaashunga rata wo machiri o nchina ninyu nikivahilhe inyu. Miyaano kiheenanelha, mena khaawo anakhalhaka mmoka aya kinrinhe aka, aahikhalhe ulhe ntu nohalha upotera, wiira Malhove Matakatifu atimire. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Paahi etu vano kinowa uwaninyu, ni mii kihoolhumacha ulha mwaha ulha velhaponi va, wiira attu yoorie ulhutaana ni mii muuteelhiyani waka.<verse eid="JHN 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />“Miyaano kihaavaha nttenga inyu, ni attu o velhaponi nkayaapangelha ichimwa, ukhalhawaya yayo kaahiwe amoka aya attu o velhaponi, thoko ni mii kihiri aka ntu o velhaponi. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Khakinolhapelha wiira mwaathamihe velhaponi, nansho kinolhapelha wiira mwenanelhe ni Nakare. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Ayo kaahiwe o velhaponi, thoko ni mii kihiri aka o velhaponi. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Mwaathanlheke mwaanene wo ikeekhene, nlhove ninyu nikhalhaka phi ikeekhene. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Thoko chikirumme inyu velhaponi, ni mii chiicho kihaaruma ayo velhaponi, <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />ni wo yoyo nlhatu uyo, miyaano kimwanene kinowithanlha kikhalhe isadaka uwaninyu ni ayo chiicho eeshiye isadaka wo ikeekhene.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Khakinaalhapelhelha ayo vekha aya, nansho kinaalhepelhelha ni attu anohalha ukirumelhelha mii wo nlhatu no nttenga waya. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Kinolhapelha wiira onkhaye akhalhe ittu imoka. Thithi, kinolhapelha wiira akhalhe nhina mwihu thoko inyuva chiri inyu nhina mwaka ni mii nhina mwinyu. Kinolhapelha wiira akhalhe ittu imoka, ilhapo iwe yaarumelhelha wiira inyuva mwaahokiruma. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Miyaano kihaavaha nthimicho yoolhe ukivanhe inyu, wiira akhalhe ittu imoka thoko ni hiyaano chiri ihu amoka. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Ilha ikhalhe wiira miyaano kikhalhe nhina mwaya, ni inyu Thithi nkhalhe nhina mwaka. Kinolhapelha wiira akhalhe ittu imoka, ilhapo ichuwelhe wiira inyuva mwaahokiruma, ni wiira, nnowaattuna ni ayo thoko chikittunne inyu mii.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />“Thithi, kinothanana ayo akivanhe inyu ayo akhalhe vamoka ni mii varii aka, awe yoona nthimicho waka ukivanhe inyu. Ukhalhawaya mwahokittuna ilhapo ihinaya wuupiya. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Thithi orera nrima, attu o velhaponi khanoochuwelhani, nansho miyaano kinouchuwelhani. Alha ni ayo ahochuwelha wiira inyuva mwahokiruma. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Kihaahimeria nchina ninyu, ni mii kinoothepa wiira chiicho, uttuna urina inyu uwannyaka uwe waakhalha nhina mwaya, ni mii kikhalhe nhina mwaya.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu noovariya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mak 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yesu amalheke wulhumacha, nkaarwa ukhopelhelhe wo nshepa wo Keduroni, vamoka ni owiittucha awe. Vavawo vakittu vawo vaari ni imata yo miri cho mizeituni, Yesu nkaakelha mwommo vamoka ni owiittucha awe. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yuda Isikariote, anthuminhe Yesu, ahochuwelha vaari aya, ukhalhawaya mikwaha chinchi Yesu aari akumaanaka ni owiittucha awe wowo. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Paahi etu, Yuda nkaarwa attukanaka mphingo wa manyaasikari ni attu olhitelhelha Inupa ya Nlhuku aarumiye ni Opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni Amafarisayo, nkaawana umatani uwo anaweelhe ikerero, ikhandiri, ni mithuko. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesu, aari achuwelhaka chonkhaye chinohalha umphwanya, nkaachusherera, nkaakoha, “Nnaavia apani?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Nkayaamwakhulha, “Yesu o Unazareti!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yesu nkeerelha, “Phi miyaano.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yuda, onthumiha Yesu aari neemenlhe vavawo vamoka ni ayo. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Paahi Yesu eereke, “Phi miyaano,” nkayaahokolhia utulhi, nkayaawulhuwa vathi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yesu nkaakoha tho, “Nnaavia apani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Nkayaamwakhulha, “Yesu o Unazareti!”<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu nkeerelha “Kihomalha uhimeriani wiira miyaano phi uyo. Paahi etu, yakhalhaka nnokaavia mii, mwahiyacheke akina alha arwaacheke.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />olhumanche yayo wiira atimire malhove yeera “Attu aakivahilhe inyu Thithi khakinrinhe anakhalhaka mmoka.”<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Nasimoni Peturo, nkayaatholholha mwaalho mulhupalhe waarina aya, nkayanthikilha nnyaru no wiimonono namitheko a Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe. Karumiya uyo eehaniya Maliki. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yesu nkeerelha Napeturo, “Nhokolhoshe mwaalho inyu nnigonerani mwaya. Chani, nnothanana kihiwurerie ikikombe yo ntwarusho ikivahilhe aya Athithi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noorwehiya wa Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Mphingo wa manyaasikari a Arumi ni mulhupalhe aya, ni akarumiya a Ayahudi, olhitelhelha Inupa ya Nlhuku nkayammara Yesu, nkayanttuka. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Nkayanrweeha wa Anasi, aari ahokohi aya Nakayafa opochera ishaani olhupalhe o yeyo iyaakha iyo. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Yayo Nakayafa ayo phi alhe olhumanche nlhove no weerelha Ayahudi wiira nambaya ntu mmoka akhwe wo nlhatu no attu enchi.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Napeturo anonkhota Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mat 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mak 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Nasimoni Peturo vamoka ni owiittucha nkina yahonttwara Yesu. Yoyo owiittucha nkina uyo aari achuwelhiyaka ni Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe, paahi etu nkaakelha vamoka ni Yesu upuwani waya Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Nansho Napeturo yaari aneemenlhe vathe, vaatameria nlhako. Paahi etu, owiittucha nkina aachuwelhiya ni Opochera ishaani olhupalhe ayo, ahokhuma vathe nkanvekelha mwalhi namitheko o uhulha nlhako wiira aawiihe Napeturo mpaani. Nkaawiiha. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Yoyo mwalhi namitheko o uhulha nlhako uyo nkaakoha Napeturo, “Chani, ni inyuva kanhiwe mmoka aya owiittucha awe ulha ntu ulha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Napeturo nkayaamwaakhulha, “Akihiwe miyaano!”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Anamitheko ni manyaasikari yaari anaparihenlhe mooro wo makhalha ukhalhawaya yaari nlhaalha wo uririya, nkayaarukureria yoottaka mooro ashinene. Napeturo nkayaarwaa ni ayo yootte mooro.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe anonkohakoha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mak 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe nkayankohakoha Yesu mwaha wo owiittucha awe ni meettuchiho awe. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu nkaamwakhulha, “Ikatema chonkhaye kaari kuulhumachaka ni attu voonene, meettuchiho aka kiituchihaka mu inupa cho unlhapelha Nlhuku ni wi Inupa yuulhupalhe ya Nlhuku, vakittu vanokumana aya Ayahudi onkhaye. Khakinapacha mena wiittuchiha iriyoothe wo uvitha. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Nlhatu waani vano nnokikoha miyaano? Mwaakoheke alhe yeewilhe koolhumanche aka. Yayo phi chuwenlhe kaahimenrie aka.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Amalheke wulhumacha yayo, namitheko olhita mmoka emenlhe vavawo nkaamwata nikofi Yesu eeraka, “Chani, nenno phi nlhove nowaakhulha Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe?”<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Yakhalhaka kuulhumanche pufia, nkahimiecheshani kittenke vayi, nansho yakhalhaka kihoolhumacha rata, woonaka nnookaata?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Anasi nkayanrweeha Yesu uno nattukiye, wa Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe Nakayafa.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Napeturo anonkhota Yesu tho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mat 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mak 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Napeturo yaari vavawo yoottaka mooro. Attu nkayaakoha, “Chani, ni inyuva kanhena owiittucha awe amoka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Napeturo nkayaakhota eeraka, “Kakihena miyaano!”<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Karumiya aya Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe mmoka, nlhoko awe ntu aakhapiye nnyaru ni Napeturo, nkaakoha, “Chani, miyaano khakowonneni inyuva umatani vamoka ni uyo?”<verse eid="JHN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Napeturo nkayakhota tho “Akihiwe mii.” Vavawo nthupi nkaweepa.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noorweehiya upuwani u Napilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mak 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Paahi etu, nkayankusha Yesu u Nakayafa, nkayanrweha upuwani wa amwene o Uyudea. Yeyo yaari mapikoosha, ni ayo wiira ahoochelhe unlhia Pasaka, khayaakenlhe mpaani ahiwe ahinanarihiye. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Wo chiichammo etu, Napilato nkayaakhuma vathe, nkayeera, “Nrina milhatu chaani ni ulha ntu ulha?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Nkayaakhulha, “Thoko ulha akaari khanatteka khanammwiiha uwaninyu.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Napilato nkayeerelha, “Munkusheke etu mwaattiva mwaashinene, nrweeke mwanhukumulheke wo ulhikaana ni Malhehero inyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Ayahudi nkayaakhulha, “Hiyaano nihochiichihiya umwiiva ntu riyoothe.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Yaapangelhe chiicho wiira atimire malhove yoolhumanche awe Yesu ulhohera naakhweke nookhwa ani.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Napilato nkayaarwaa upuwani tho, nkayaamwiihana Yesu ni unkoha, “Eti inyuva phi Mwene Ayahudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Chani, yayo malhove ayo anokhuma mmuruni mwinyu ama attu akina phi uhimenrieni mwaha aka?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Napilato nkayaakhulha, “Chani, ki Nyahudi mii? Attu o velhaponi winyu ni attu opochera ishaani olhupalhe phi uwinheni uwannyaka. Nttekilheni?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Umwene aka kuhiwe wo velhaponi va. Umwene aka wakaari wo velhaponi va, anamitheko aka aanokinkelha kihivariye ni Ayahudi. Mena, umwene aka kuhiwe wo velhaponi vaa.”<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Vavawo Napilato nkayaamwiirelha Yesu, “Paahi etu, inyuva Amwene?” Yesu nkaakhulha, “Inyuva nhohimia wiira miyaano Mwene. Miyaano kiyareelhe wo yoyo nlhatu uyo, ni wo yoyo nlhatu uyo kihowa velhaponi uhimiechesha wa attu mwaha we ikeekhene. Kila ntu novara ikeekhene nookiwelhelha.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Napilato nkayaakoha, “Ikeekhene phi ishiyani?”</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 18:38">Yesu noohukumulhiya wiiviya</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mat 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mak 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Napilato yamalheke wulhumacha yayo, nkayaakhuma tho vathe waari aya Ayahudi, nkayeerelha, “Miyaano khakinoona nlhatu uriyoothe wiira ulha ntu ulha hotteka. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Ukhalhawaya mwaatti nhanaa malhemalhelho o uttukulhelhani ntu mmoka vanophiya aya ikatema yo Pasaka, paahi etu, nnoothanana vano kuuttukulhelheni Mwene Ayahudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Vavawo nkayakhuwelhacha yiiraka, “Mena! Kahena ulha hii ninonthanana Baraba!” Yoyo Baraba uyo aari ntu o uvara makhuche.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Paahi, Napilato nkaalhehera wiira Yesu aatiye ikopo. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Manyaasikari nkayaavilhika mphumburu wo miiwa, nkayammwariha mmuruni, nkayammwariha mwiinjiro wo irangi yo zambarau. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Nkayaawa ni unveehacha yiiraka, “Moyoo, Amwene Ayahudi!” Nkayaamwata makofi.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Napilato nkayakhuma tho vathe, nkayeera, “Nkoonani, kinommwiiha vano uwaninyu, nchuwelheke wiira miyaano khakoonne nlhatu uriyoothe uwannyawe.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Paahi, Yesu nkaakhumihiya vathe nawanre mphumburu wo miiwa ni mwiinjiro we imwene. Napilato nkayeerelha, “Mmweheke! Ntu mwanene uyo phi ulha.”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Opochera ishaani olhupalhe ni anamitheko olhita Inupa ya Nlhuku vaamwonne aya nkayakhuwelha yiiraka, “Akomelhelhiye vansalaabani! Akhomelhelhiye vansalaabani!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Napilato nkayeerelha, “Munkusheke etu vano mwaattiva mwaashinene, mwamwiiveke. Ukhalhawaya miyaano khakoonne nlhatu uriyoothe wiira hotteka.” <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Ayahudi nkayaamwakhulha, “Hiyaano nihanaa Malhehero, ineera wiira hophwanelhiya ukhwa, ukhalhawaya heepanga Mwaana a Nlhuku.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Napilato yeeweke yayo malhove ayo, nkayaathepa woova. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Nkayaakelha tho mpaani, nkayankoha Yesu, “Inyuva nkhume vayi?” Nansho Yesu khaakhunlhe. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Napilato nkayaamwirelha, “Woonaka khannottuna wulhumacha ni mii? Chani, khanchuwenlhe wiira mii kihanaa ikuru yo uhiyererani ni ikuru yo ukhomelhelhani vansalaabani?” <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Khamwaakhalha ni ikuru iriyoothe vachulhu waka mwahakaavahiye ukhuma wiirimu. Paahi etu, ntu kiwinhe uwaninyu uyo yoyo ri o uwonya chinene.” <verse eid="JHN 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Ukhuma vavawo, Napilato nkayaavia iphiro yo unhiyerera, nansho Ayahudi nkayaanyakulha yiiraka, “Mwanhiyereraka ulha ntu ulha, inyuva kanhiwe anlhoko aya Akaisari o Urumi, kila ntu neepanga ukhalha mwene nowaathunalhiha Akaisari o Urumi!”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Paahi, Napilato veewilhe aya yayo malhove ayo nkayammwiiha Yesu vathe, nkayakhalhelha ihiche yo waahukumulhelha attu, vakittu vaneehaniya we Iebraniya Gabatha maana aya “Mmuto wo Malhuku.” <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Waari uthana, nihuku no wiicheesha rata wo nihuku no Pasaka. Napilato nkayeerelha Ayahudi, “Mummweheke, Mwene inyu!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Attu nkayaakhuwelha, “Munthamihe! Munthamihe! Mwankhomelhelhe vansalaabani!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Napilato nkayaakoha, “Chani, kinkhomelhelheke Mwene inyu vansalaabani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe nkayaakhulha, “Hiyaano khanirina mwene nkina ahikhalhe Akaisari o Urumi!”<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Vavawo, Napilato nkayankumiha Yesu nkaavaha ammwie anrweehe akhomelhelhiye vansalaabani.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesu nookhomelhelhiya vansalaabani</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mak 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Paahi etu, nkayankusha Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Ni uyo nkaakumihiya nakunshe nsalaaba awe arweehiyaka vakittu vaneehaniya we Iebraniya Gologota, maana aya Nikhurukucha no Muru. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Vavawo phi vakittu vaakhomelhelhiye awe Yesu. Aakhomelhelhiye vamoka ni attu akina elhi, mmoka wiimonono ni nkina wiimushi wawe. Yesu aari variyari. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Napilato nkayaalhepa nlhove vakibaoni ni ukhomelhelha vachulhu nsalaaba. Nlhove naalhepiye nno neera, “Yesu o Unazareti, Mwene a Ayahudi.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Ayahudi enchi yahoshoma nenno nlhove nno, ukhalhawaya vaakhomelhelhiye awe Yesu vawo, vaari vakiviru ni vawani. Ni nlhove nno naari ninalhepiye wo moolhumo e Iebraniya, Ilatini, ni Iyunani. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Opochera ishaani olhupalhe nkayeerelha Napilato, “Nhilhepe wiira, ‘Mwene a Ayahudi,’ nansho nlhepeke, ‘Ntu enre, Miyaano phi Mwene a Ayahudi.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Napilato nkayaakhulha, “Kilhempe aka, kiholhepa!”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Manyaasikari yamalheke unkhomelhelha Yesu vansalaabani, nkayaawia ikuwo chawe, nkayaakawa vacheshe, kila nsikari nifungu nimoka. Nkayaakusha chiicho ni mwiinjiro awe nkina, waari wo ttaviya ikuwo imoka yaalhutanne, wo hitottiya. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Paahi etu, manyaaasikari nkayeewanana ashineneru wiira, “Ilha nihaahulhe, noopeke ikhura yo ulhamulha inaakhalheke ya apani.” Yoyo mwaha uyo waapangia atimire Malhove Matakatifu aneera</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">“Yahokawana ikuwo chaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">ni mwiinjiro aka wahoopelhiya ikhura.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Paahi etu, phi chiicho chapannge aya manyaasikari ayo.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Vaatameria nsalaaba waakhomelhelhiye Yesu yaari aneemenlhe anumwanawe, ni arokoraya anumwanawe, ni Amariamu ahanu a Nakileopa, ni Amariamu Magidalena. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesu nkoona anumwanawe, ni owiittucha anttunne awe aneemenlhe, nkeerelha anumwanawe, “Amma! Mummweheke, vano ulha phi mwamwaninyu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Tho nkaamwirelha owiittucha ulhe, “Mwaaweheke, alha phi anumwaninyu vano.” Uchokholhelha vavawo, yoyo owiittucha uyo nkaakusha Amariamu nkaakhalhana uwannyawe.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukhwa wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mak 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Yamalhekeru, Yesu nkoona wiira onkhaye ahotimira, ni wo utimiriha Malhove Matakatifu nkeera, “Kinoona nttona.”<verse eid="JHN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Vavawo yahokhalha ni ikahi yaachanre idivai yo uhichasha. Paahi, nkayaruwia mdodoki mu divaini mmo, nkayaattuka munthalheni, nkayaamweshera vamalhakuni. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yesu amalheke utoolha idivai iyo, nkeera, “Mitheko chihotimira!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Yamalheke nkooroma muru, nkaahiya nrima.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noohomiya nivaka vapararini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Paahi ahoolhelhi Ayahudi nkayaavekelha Napilato wiira oonthe mieto cha attu aakhomelhelhiye, ni ukurusha mitembo chaya vansalaabani. Yaari avekelhaka ukhalhawaya yaari nihuku no ijumaa, nihuku no wiicheesha rata. Wo chiicho, iruttu chihihalhe mmisalaabani Nihuku no Wiittuwa, ukhalhawaya nenno nihuku nno naari nulhupalhe chinene. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Paahi etu, manyaasikari nkayaarwaa, nkayamuntha mieto ntu aakhomelhelhiye wiiminono, ni nkina o wiimushi, attu yaakhomelhelhiye vamoka ni Yesu alhe. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Nansho yamphiyelheke Yesu, nkayoona wiira homalha ukhwa, wo chiichammo etu khayoonthe mieto chawe. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Nsikari mmoka nkanhoma nivaka Yesu vapararini, wo uhipicha nkayaakhuma iphome ni maashi. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Ni uyo onne chechiyo ahoonechesha inyu mwaatti nrumelhelhe. Ni malhove yuulhumanche awe phi ikeekhene, ni uyo hochuwelha wiira uhimiechesha wawe phi ikeekhene. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Yoyo mwaha uyo waapangelhe Malhove Matakatifu atimire, “Khaniwo nikhuva nawe inakhalhaka nimoka ninohalha wunthiya.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Tho Malhove Matakatifu aneera, “Anommweha ulhe anhomilhe aya nivaka.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu noovithiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mak 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Umalha waya yayo, Nayusufu, anenchi o Uarimathaya, yahaavekelha Napilato nipesha no ukusha iruttu ya Yesu. Nayusufu yaari owiittucha a Yesu, nansho wo wiivitha, ukhalhawaya yaanoova ahoolhelhi a Ayahudi. Paahi, Napilato nkayaahiyera. Nayusufu nkayarwaa, nkayakurusha iruttu ya Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nayusufu, yaarweelhe vamoka ni Nanikodemo yaathonke mahuku o utulhi ayo unrweelha Yesu uhiyu. Aawiilhe anakunshe manemane aathakanihiye ni ubani wo umalhaka iratili imia imoka o wootiha ntembo wa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Attu elhi ayo etu, nkayakusha iruttu ya Yesu, nkayaavilhikelha ikuwo yo uvithelha vamoka ni makhura ulhikaana ni malhemalhelho a Ayahudi o uvithaniya. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Vavawo vakittu vakhomelhelhiye awe Yesu vawo vaari ni imata, ni mwommo mmatani mmo mwaari ni nihiye no naanano nihinavithiya ntu riyoothe nhina mwaya. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Ukhalhawaya naari nihuku ni Ayahudi no wiicheesha rata wo Nihuku no Wiittuwa, ni ukhalhawaya nihiye nno naari vakhiviru, nkayeesha iruttu ya Yesu mwommo.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu hohihimmwa nnookhwani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mak 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Mapikoosha o nihuku no Jumaapili, Amariamu Magidalena yahorwaa unihiyeni, nkayoona wiira nlhuku naakhuneelhiye nihothamihiya vanlhakoni vo nihiye vawo. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Nkayaarwaa attimakachaka urwaa wa Nasimoni Peturo ni owiittucha nkina attuniye ni Yesu, nkayeerelha, “Ahaathamiha Athithi nnihiyeni, ni hii khanichuwenlhe weeshiye aya.”<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Napeturo vamoka ni owiittucha nkina uyo nkayarwaa unihiyeni. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Onkhaye oyelhi aari attawaka nansho owiittucha nkina uyo ahottawa chinene waapwaha Napeturo, nkaaholhelha uphiya unihiyeni. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Nkooroma ni uthurumelha, nkoona ikuwo yo uvithelha inavilhikachiye, nansho khaakenlhe nhina. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Nasimoni Peturo ni ayo nkayaawa anttwaraka, nkaakelha nnihiyeni, mwommo nkayoona ikuwo yaavithelhiye Yesu, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />ni ikitambaa yaakhunelhiye awe Yesu mmuruni ilhe. Yeyo ikitambaa iyo khayaari vamoka ni ikuwo iyo, nansho yaari inavilhikiye umuruni, thoko chaari aya. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Yamalheke owiittucha nkina aaholhenlhe uphiya unihiyeni uyo, nkaakelha ni uyo nhina. Nkoona, nkarumelhelha. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Yaari ahinaya uchuwelha Malhove Matakatifu yeenre wiira noohihimmwa ukhuma nnookhwani. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Paahi etu owiittucha ayo nkayaahokolhiacha uwani.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowaakhumelhelha Amariamu Magidalena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mak 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Amariamu yaari aneemenlhe vathe vo nihiye, onlhaka. Uno anari onlhaka, nkayooroma ni uthurumelha nnihiyeni, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />nkayoona minepa elhi aawanre ikuwo chootelha ttuuu, anakhanlhe vaathalhelhiye aya iruttu ya Yesu, mmoka umuruni nkina umietoni. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Minepa nkachaakoha Amariamu, “Maanyi, nnonlhani?” Amariamu nkayaakhulha, “Ahaakusha Athithi aka, ni mii akichuwenlhe weeshiye aya!”<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Amalhiheke wulhumacha yayo, nkaarukunuwa utulhi, nkayamwoona Yesu neemenlhe vavawo, nansho khayanchuwelhe wiira aari phi Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu nkaakoha, “Maanyi, nnonlhani? Nnaavia apani?” Amariamu, yaanyiheraka wiira yoyo ntu uyo aari mwanene imata, nkayaakhulha, “Munna, yakhalhaka phi inyuva mwathaminhe, nkihimerie mwenshe vayi, ni mii kinorwaa waakusha.” <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu nkeerelha, “Khu Amariamu!” Ni ayo Amariamu nkayarukunuwa, nkayoolhumacha wo Iebraniya, “Raboni.” Maana aya akhalhaka, “Owiittuchiha.” <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu nkaachiichiha eeraka, “Nhikivare, khakinarwaa kaye uchulhu wa Athithi. Nansho nrweeke wa ashilhoko mwaahimerieke wiira, kinokelha nchulhu wa Athumwanaka arii Athumwanaya, Nlhuku aka ri Nlhuku aya.” <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Paahi etu Amariamu Magidalena nkayaarwaa ni waahimeria owiittucha alhe wiira, “Kihoona Athithi!” Ni waahimeria malhove aahimenrie aya.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowaakhumelhelha owiittucha awe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mak 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Yaari uchechilho yo nenno nihuku no Jumaapili nno, owiittucha yaari anathukumanne vamoka mpaani milhako chaari chinatteiye, nlhatu no woova ahoolhelhi a Yahudi. Paahi Yesu nkaakhumelhelha ni weemelha variyari aya, nkeerelha, “Mpuha ukhalhe ni inyu!” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Amalheke wulhumacha yayo, nkooniha miono chawe ni niparari nawe. Owiittucha nkayaatelhiya chinene woona Athithi. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu nkeerelhacha tho, “Mpuha ukhalhe ni inyu! Thoko Athithi chikirumme aya, ni mii kinourumani mwaattiva.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Amalhiheke, nkaawuchelhelha ni weerelha, “Mumpochereke Iphumu ya Nlhuku. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Mwaahiyereraka attu uwonya waya, anoohiyereriya, mwaahahiyerereke, khaanohiyereriya.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ni Natomaso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Natomaso amoka aya khumi ni elhi alhe aneehaniya Nivata, khayaatamme ikatema Yesu vaawilhe awe. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Paahi etu, owiittucha akina akhunanaya ayo nkayeera, “Nihoona Athithi!” Natomaso nkayeera, “Kaahoneke marottelha o ikhomo mmathathani mwawe ni ukelhiha nikokho naka mmarottelhani mmo, ni uhelha moono aka mpararini mwawe, khakirumelhelhaka.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Yavireke mahuku mathanu ni mararu owiittucha ayo yaari anathukumanne tho vamoka mpaani, Natomaso ahaatama na ayo. Milhako chaari chinatteiye, nansho Yesu nkaakelha, nkeemelha variyari aya, nkeera, “Mpuha ukhalhe ni inyu!” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Amalhiheke nkeerelha Natomaso, “Mmwiiheke nikokho ninyu vaa, mmweheke ni miono chaka, mmwiiheke moono inyu uyo nkelhiheke mpararini mwaka. Nhiyeke ulhipa nrima uwo, nrumelhelheke!” <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Natomaso nkayaakhulha, “Athithi ni Nlhuku aka!” <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesu nkeerelha, “Chani, nnorumelhelha ukhalhawaya nhookoona? Ahoreeriya yayo anorumelhelha, nansho wo hikoona mii!”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnikwa uri nkitabuni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu ahopanga cho ushangiha chikina chinchi vaari awe na owiittucha awe chihilhepiye nhina ilha ikitabu ilha. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Nansho chilha chilhepiye mwaatti nrumelhelhe wiira Yesu phi Kuristo Moopolhi, Mwaana a Nlhuku, ni wo urumelhelha winyu mpatte ukhalha ni ukumi wo ikuru yo nchina nawe.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowakhumelhelha owiittucha athanu ni elhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Umalhawaya, Yesu nkaakhumelhelha tho owiittucha awe vachereshere nttiya no Utiberiya. Aakhumelhenlhe choo <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Nasimoni Peturo ni Natomaso aneehaniya Nivata, ni Nanathanieli anenchi o Ukaana yo Ugalilaya, ni ashaana elhi a Nazebedayo ni owiittucha awe akina elhi, yaari onkhaye vamoka. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Nasimoni Peturo nkayeerelha akhunanaya, “Kinokelha uvarani ihopa.” Ni ayo nkayaamwiirelha, “Ni hii ninoorwaa vamoka ni inyu.” Nkayaarwaa nkalhavani, nansho yoyo uhiyu uyo khayaapantte ittu. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Nchuwa vaakhuma aya, Yesu nkeemelha vachereshere nttiya, nansho owiittucha awe khayaachuwenlhe wiira aari phi Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Paahi etu Yesu nkaakohacha, “Mwaatti, khannapatta ihopa ngati?” Ni ayo nkayaamwaakhulha, “Eiyo khaninapatta ittu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Yesu nkeerelha, “Ntikhelheke ittavi mpantta wo wiimonono wo ikalhava ni inyu nnoovara ihopa.” Paahi etu, nkayaatikhelha ittavi nansho khayoonrie upurulha, ukhalhawaya ihopa chaavanre aya chahothepa winchiva. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Owiittucha aattuniye ni Yesu ulhe nkeerelha Napeturo, “Athithi!” Napeturo yeeweke wiira aari Athithi, nkayettuka mwiinjiro aya ukhalhawaya aari aneekokotenre, nkayaathuphelha mmaashini. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Nansho owiittucha akina nkayaawa uchengweni nkalhavani uno apurulhaka nttavi naachanre ihopa, khawaari utayi, yaari woomalhaka ihatua imia imoka vaneemelha maashi. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Yaphiyeke vachengweni nkayoonacha ihopa chinaaneelhiye vamakhalhani ni nkatte. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu nkeerelhacha, “Mmwiiheke vaa vakani ihopa chimennje inyu chiyo.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Nasimoni Peturo nkayaawelha nkalhavani, nkayaapurulhelha nttavi vachengweni ninachanre ihopa chulhupalhe imia imoka makhumi nthanu ni taru. Inakhalhaka chiicho, nttavi khanaapaphuwilhe. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu nkeerelha, “Mmwaacheke vaa etu mmwe mwaalhia.” Khaawo anakhalha owiittucha mmoka onrie unkoha, “Inyuva phi apani?” Ukhalhawaya yahochuwelha wiira yaari Athithi. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesu nkaawa, nkaakusha nkatte, nkaavaha, nkaapanga chiichammo ni ihopa chilhe.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Ulha, waari nkwaha wo neraru Yesu waakhumelhelha owiittucha awe, ukhuma vaahihimmwe awe.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nowareriha ni Napeturo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Yamalhiheke ulhia, Yesu nkaakoha Nasimoni Peturo, “Nasimoni, mwaana a Nayohana! Chani, nnookittuna mii waapwaha alha akina alha?” Ni ayo nkayaakhulha, “Eiyo, Thithi, nnochuwelha wiira miyaano kinouttunani.” Yesu nkeerelha, “Nshunge ashaana o ikhondoro chaka.”<verse eid="JHN 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Nkeerelha tho ninayelhi, “Nasimoni mwaana a Nayohana! Chani, nnokittuna?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Napeturo nkayaakhulha, “Eiyo, Thithi, nnoochuwelha wiira kinouttunani.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Yesu nkeerelha, “Nshunge ikhondoro chaka.”<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Nkaakoha yo neraru, “Nasimoni mwaana a Nayohana! Chani, nnokittuna?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Vavawo Napeturo nkayaachukulha wo nlhatu nookohiya wo neraru, “Nnokittuna?” Nkayaakhulha yiiraka, “Thithi, inyuva nhochuwelha chonkhaye, inyuva nnoochuwelha wiira miyaano kinouttunani.” Yesu nkeerelha, “Nshunge ikhondoro chaka! <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Ikekheene kinouhimeriani, vaari inyu amirawo mwaholhemalhelha wiittuka nchako ni ukelha uriwoothe waathanana inyu. Nansho vanohalha inyu wuulhuvalha, nnowookolha miono chinyu, ni ntu nkina nouttukani ni urweehani uhinothanana inyu urwaa.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Wo wulhumacha chiicho, ahooniha iphiro yaani Napeturo anohalha aya uvira muukhwani ni unthimicha Nlhuku. Amalhiheke nkeerelha, “Nkittware.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ni owiittucha nkina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Vavawo Napeturo nkayarukunuwa, nkayaamwona owiittucha aattuniye ni Yesu ulhe, noottwara. Ulha phi owiittucha aakhanlhe amwaatameriaka chinene Yesu ikatema yaalhiaya yolhia yo uchechilho, ni unkoha “Thithi phi apani anohalha uthumihani?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Napeturo vaamwonne aya yoyo attwaraka, nkayankoha Yesu, “Thithi ni alha mwaha aya uri chani?” <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu nkaakhulha, “Yakhalhaka wiira kinothanana alha ahalheke mpaka vanohalha aka uwa tho, irini uwaninyu? Inyu nkittwareke mii!” <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Paahi etu, yoyo mwaha uyo nkawawanelha munlhokoni mwa attu anttwara na owiittucha awe wiira yoyo owiittucha uyo kanokhwa. Nansho Yesu khenre wiira yoyo owiittucha uyo khankhwa, nansho enre “Yakhalhaka wiira kinothanana alha ahalhe mpaka vanottuna aka uwa, irini uwaninyu?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ulha phi owiittucha nohimiechesha ni ulhepa ulha mwaha ulha. Ni hii ninoochuwelha wiira himianche awe iri ye ikekhiaye.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umalhihera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Chihawo chittu chikina chinchi chaapangilhe awe Yesu, yakaari chaholhepiya chonkhaye, imoka kaanyuma yo ikina, kinaanyihera wiira ilhapo khayooria ukhalha ichitabu chikaalhepiye chiyo.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>